msgstr ""
"Ett av attributets värden, angivet med term-id; eller ange det med `slug`."

#: src/Abilities/SetAttributeBlankOption.php:98
#: src/Abilities/SetAttributeChoicePrice.php:67
#: src/Abilities/SetAttributeQueryName.php:69
#: src/Abilities/SetAttributeSplitListing.php:92
msgid "No global attribute has this id."
msgstr "Inget globalt attribut har detta id."

#. translators: 1: the blank option asked for. 2: the options there are, comma-separated. Error an AI assistant or an MCP client reads.
#: src/Abilities/SetAttributeBlankOption.php:109
#, php-format
msgid ""
"No blank the products with this attribute use has the option \"%1$s\". "
"Options: %2$s."
msgstr ""
"Ingen grundprodukt som produkterna med detta attribut använder har "
"alternativet ”%1$s”. Alternativ: %2$s."

#: src/Abilities/SetAttributeBlankOption.php:117
msgid ""
"A value given is not one of the attribute's values: name each by its "
"`term_id` or `slug`."
msgstr ""
"Ett angivet värde är inte ett av attributets värden: ange vart och ett med "
"dess `term_id` eller `slug`."

#. translators: %s: the value asked for. Error an AI assistant or an MCP client reads.
#: src/Abilities/SetAttributeBlankOption.php:123
#, php-format
msgid ""
"\"%s\" is not a page count: give a whole number of inner pages, such as 44."
msgstr ""
"”%s” är inte ett sidantal: ange ett heltal sidor i inlagan, till exempel 44."

#. translators: 1: the option value asked for. 2: the blank option. 3: its values, comma-separated. Error an AI assistant or an MCP client reads.
#: src/Abilities/SetAttributeBlankOption.php:129
#, php-format
msgid "\"%1$s\" is not a value of the option \"%2$s\". Values: %3$s."
msgstr "”%1$s” är inte ett värde i alternativet ”%2$s”. Värden: %3$s."

#. translators: Error an AI assistant or an MCP client reads. `recheck-products` is the name of another ability; keep it as it is.
#: src/Abilities/SetAttributeBlankOption.php:169
msgid ""
"The link is saved, but the products with this attribute could not be queued "
"for a re-check, so they keep the blank variants they had. Run `recheck-"
"products` to re-check them."
msgstr ""
"Kopplingen är sparad, men produkterna med detta attribut kunde inte köas för "
"en ny kontroll, så de behåller de grundproduktvarianter de hade. Kör "
"`recheck-products` för att kontrollera dem på nytt."

#. translators: Name of an ability an AI assistant or an MCP client can use on the store.
#: src/Abilities/SetAttributeChoicePrice.php:29
msgid "Set the price an attribute's choices show"
msgstr "Ange vilket pris ett attributs val visar"

#: src/Abilities/SetAttributeChoicePrice.php:30
msgid ""
"Sets the price a global attribute's options show on a product page, as its "
"edit screen's \"Price beside each choice\" field does. `add_on` for an add-"
"on such as a hanger, a frame or a frame's finish: each option shows what it "
"adds to the product without add-ons in the chosen size and personalisation "
"(\"+180 kr\"), worked out from the variations' prices; the cheapest option "
"shows nothing, and a finish shows its difference to the cheapest finish "
"under the chosen framing. `from` for a base choice such as a size: each "
"option shows its lowest price (\"from 469 kr\"). `price` for a base choice "
"such as a size: each option shows the price the product has with it and the "
"shopper's other choices (\"599 kr\"), and none while those choices leave "
"more than one price. `none` shows no price. Prices count only variations in "
"stock, and show beside the swatches or in the theme's own option field. The "
"answer is the attribute's choice now."
msgstr ""
"Anger vilket pris ett globalt attributs alternativ visar på en produktsida, "
"som fältet \"Pris vid varje val\" på dess redigeringssida gör. `add_on` för "
"ett tillval som en upphängning, en ram eller en ramfärg: varje alternativ "
"visar vad det lägger till på produkten utan tillval i vald storlek och "
"personalisering (\"+180 kr\"), räknat ur varianternas priser; det billigaste "
"alternativet visar inget, och en ramfärg visar skillnaden mot den billigaste "
"ramfärgen för vald inramning. `from` för ett grundval som en storlek: varje "
"alternativ visar sitt lägsta pris (\"från 469 kr\"). `price` för ett "
"grundval som en storlek: varje alternativ visar produktens pris med det och "
"kundens övriga val (\"599 kr\"), och inget så länge de valen ger mer än ett "
"pris. `none` visar inget pris. Priserna räknar bara med varianter i lager "
"och visas bredvid knapparna eller i temats eget fält för alternativen. "
"Svaret är attributets val nu."

#: src/Abilities/SetAttributeChoicePrice.php:70
msgid "The price must be none, add_on, from or price."
msgstr "Priset måste vara none, add_on, from eller price."

#. translators: Name of an ability an AI assistant or an MCP client can use on the store.
#: src/Abilities/SetAttributeQueryName.php:30
msgid "Set the name an attribute goes by in the shop's addresses"
msgstr "Ange namnet som ett attribut har i butikens webbadresser"

#: src/Abilities/SetAttributeQueryName.php:31
msgid ""
"Sets the name a product page's address and the shop's filters give a global "
"attribute, as its edit screen's \"Name in addresses\" field does: `size` "
"makes `?size=50x70-cm`. Lowercase letters and digits, words joined by a "
"hyphen or an underscore. An empty name gives it back its slug. A name "
"WordPress or WooCommerce reads from an address, or that another attribute "
"goes by, is refused. Links shared with the old name no longer choose the "
"value. The answer is the attribute's name now."
msgstr ""
"Anger namnet som en produktsidas webbadress och butikens filter ger ett "
"globalt attribut, som fältet ”Namn i webbadresser” på attributets "
"redigeringssida gör: `size` ger `?size=50x70-cm`. Små bokstäver och siffror, "
"med ord sammanfogade med bindestreck eller understreck. Ett tomt namn ger "
"attributet dess slug tillbaka. Ett namn som WordPress eller WooCommerce "
"läser från en webbadress, eller som ett annat attribut redan har, nekas. "
"Länkar som delats med det gamla namnet väljer inte längre värdet. Svaret är "
"attributets namn nu."

#. translators: Name of an ability an AI assistant or an MCP client can use on the store.
#: src/Abilities/SetAttributeSplitListing.php:36
msgid "Set how an attribute lists its values in the shop"
msgstr "Ange hur ett attribut visar sina värden i butiken"

#: src/Abilities/SetAttributeSplitListing.php:37
msgid ""
"Sets a global attribute's \"Cards in the shop\" setting, as its edit screen "
"does: `on` lists a variable product using it for its variations once per "
"value; `filtered` does so only while a filter of the shop chooses a value of "
"it, as for a framing that should not make cards of its own but should show "
"the framed card while the customer filters by it; `off` makes no card per "
"value. Each product on `auto` for the attribute follows it (`get-product-"
"split-listing`, `set-product-split-listing`). The answer is the attribute's "
"setting now."
msgstr ""
"Anger ett globalt attributs inställning \"Kort i butiken\", på samma sätt "
"som dess redigeringssida: `on` visar en variabel produkt som använder "
"attributet för sina varianter en gång per värde; `filtered` gör det bara när "
"ett filter i butiken väljer ett av dess värden, som för en inramning som "
"inte ska få egna kort men ska visa det inramade kortet när kunden filtrerar "
"på den; `off` ger inget kort per värde. Varje produkt som har `auto` för "
"attributet följer inställningen (`get-product-split-listing`, `set-product-"
"split-listing`). Svaret är attributets inställning nu."

#: src/Abilities/SetAttributeSplitListing.php:95
msgid "The mode is not one of on, filtered or off."
msgstr "Läget är inte något av on, filtered eller off."

#. translators: Name of an ability an AI assistant or an MCP client can use on the store.
#: src/Abilities/SetProductForm.php:64
msgid "Arrange a product's designer form"
msgstr "Ordna formuläret i en produkts designverktyg"

#: src/Abilities/SetProductForm.php:65
msgid ""
"Arranges a simple or variable product's designer form, as its Pixonaut tab "
"does: the `form_groups` of each side named by its `key` (null for the "
"template's own form), `option_groups`, `group_numbers`, `form_layout` and "
"`layout`. Only what is given changes: a side left out keeps its arrangement, "
"and the sides, their templates, placements and print sizes, and the "
"variations' own setups are kept. Read what an arrangement may name with `get-"
"product-form`: an option the product does not have, or a field or group its "
"template does not offer, refuses the whole call and the answer says each. "
"The answer is the product's form now, as `get-product-form` gives it."
msgstr ""
"Ordnar formuläret i designverktyget för en enkel eller variabel produkt, så "
"som produktens Pixonaut-flik gör: `form_groups` för varje sida som anges med "
"sin `key` (null för mallens eget formulär), `option_groups`, "
"`group_numbers`, `form_layout` och `layout`. Bara det som anges ändras: en "
"sida som utelämnas behåller sin formulärordning, och sidorna, deras mallar, "
"placeringar och tryckstorlekar samt varianternas egna inställningar behålls. "
"Läs vad en formulärordning får nämna med `get-product-form`: ett alternativ "
"som produkten inte har, eller ett fält eller en grupp som dess mall inte "
"erbjuder, gör att hela anropet avvisas, och svaret nämner var och en. Svaret "
"är produktens formulär som det är nu, så som `get-product-form` ger det."

#: src/Abilities/SetProductForm.php:82
msgid "One of the product's sides, by its key."
msgstr "En av produktens sidor, angiven med sin nyckel."

#: src/Abilities/SetProductForm.php:90 src/Abilities/SetProductSetup.php:81
msgid "The product page layout; empty for the store's."
msgstr "Produktsidans layout; tom för butikens."

#: src/Abilities/SetProductForm.php:91 src/Abilities/SetProductSetup.php:82
msgid "The form layout; empty for the store's."
msgstr "Formulärlayouten; tom för butikens."

#: src/Abilities/SetProductForm.php:92
msgid ""
"Where the product's options stand on a side not arranged by hand: `on_top`, "
"unnumbered, or each in a group of its own, `first` or `last`; empty for the "
"store's."
msgstr ""
"Var produktens alternativ står på en sida som inte har ordnats för hand: "
"`on_top`, överst och onumrerade, eller vart och ett i en egen grupp, `first` "
"eller `last`; tom för butikens."

#: src/Abilities/SetProductForm.php:93
msgid "Whether the form numbers its groups; empty for the store's."
msgstr "Om formuläret numrerar sina grupper; tom för butikens."

#: src/Abilities/SetProductForm.php:120
msgid ""
"Give `sides`, `option_groups`, `group_numbers`, `form_layout` or `layout`."
msgstr ""
"Ange `sides`, `option_groups`, `group_numbers`, `form_layout` eller `layout`."

#: src/Abilities/SetProductForm.php:127
msgid ""
"The product has no Pixonaut setup, so it has no form to arrange. Link it to "
"a template first."
msgstr ""
"Produkten har ingen Pixonaut-inställning, så den har inget formulär att "
"ordna. Koppla den till en mall först."

#: src/Abilities/SetProductForm.php:137
msgid ""
"The product's Pixonaut setup was changed while this was saved, so nothing "
"was changed. Read it again with `get-product-form`, then set it."
msgstr ""
"Produktens Pixonaut-inställning ändrades medan detta sparades, så ingenting "
"ändrades. Läs den igen med `get-product-form` och ange den sedan."

#. translators: %s: a side's key. Why an AI assistant's change to the store was refused.
#: src/Abilities/SetProductForm.php:165
#, php-format
msgid "the product has no side `%s`"
msgstr "produkten har ingen sida `%s`"

#. translators: %s: a side's key. Why an AI assistant's change to the store was refused.
#: src/Abilities/SetProductForm.php:170
#, php-format
msgid "side `%s` is given twice"
msgstr "sidan `%s` anges två gånger"

#. translators: %s: every problem found, joined by semicolons. Why an AI assistant's change to the store was refused.
#: src/Abilities/SetProductForm.php:187
#, php-format
msgid "Nothing was saved: %s."
msgstr "Ingenting sparades: %s."

#. translators: %s: a side's key. Why an AI assistant's change to the store was refused.
#: src/Abilities/SetProductForm.php:216
#, php-format
msgid "side `%s` has no template to arrange"
msgstr "sidan `%s` har ingen mall att ordna"

#: src/Abilities/SetProductForm.php:217
msgid ""
"Pixonaut could not be asked for the template's fields, so the arrangement "
"was not checked and nothing was saved. Try again."
msgstr ""
"Det gick inte att hämta mallens fält från Pixonaut, så formulärordningen "
"kontrollerades inte och ingenting sparades. Försök igen."

#. translators: 1: a group's id; 2: a side's key. Why an AI assistant's change to the store was refused.
#: src/Abilities/SetProductForm.php:227
#, php-format
msgid ""
"group `%1$s` on side `%2$s` takes an id the product page uses for itself: "
"pick another"
msgstr ""
"gruppen `%1$s` på sidan `%2$s` har ett id som produktsidan själv använder: "
"välj ett annat"

#. translators: 1: a group's id; 2: a side's key. Why an AI assistant's change to the store was refused.
#: src/Abilities/SetProductForm.php:231
#, php-format
msgid "group `%1$s` on side `%2$s` is the product's own and needs a title"
msgstr ""
"gruppen `%1$s` på sidan `%2$s` är produktens egen och behöver en rubrik"

#. translators: 1: a group's id; 2: a side's key; 3: the prefix of a group of the product's own. Why an AI assistant's change to the store was refused.
#: src/Abilities/SetProductForm.php:233
#, php-format
msgid ""
"the template of side `%2$s` has no group `%1$s` (a group of the product's "
"own takes an id starting with `%3$s`)"
msgstr ""
"mallen för sidan `%2$s` har ingen grupp `%1$s` (en av produktens egna "
"grupper har ett id som börjar med `%3$s`)"

#. translators: %s: an attribute's slug. Why an AI assistant's change to the store was refused.
#: src/Abilities/SetProductForm.php:240
#, php-format
msgid "the product has no option `%s` its customers choose a variation by"
msgstr ""
"produkten har inget alternativ `%s` som kunderna väljer en variant efter"

#. translators: 1: a field, `<layerId>:<prop>`; 2: a side's key. Why an AI assistant's change to the store was refused.
#: src/Abilities/SetProductForm.php:243
#, php-format
msgid "the template of side `%2$s` offers no field `%1$s`"
msgstr "mallen för sidan `%2$s` erbjuder inget fält `%1$s`"

#. translators: %s: a side's key. Why an AI assistant's change to the store was refused.
#: src/Abilities/SetProductForm.php:262
#, php-format
msgid ""
"the form of side `%s` names no `groups`: give null for the template's own "
"form"
msgstr ""
"formuläret för sidan `%s` nämner inga `groups`: ange null för mallens eget "
"formulär"

#. translators: 1: a side's key; 2: the most groups a form keeps. Why an AI assistant's change to the store was refused.
#: src/Abilities/SetProductForm.php:266
#, php-format
msgid "the form of side `%1$s` has more than %2$d groups"
msgstr "formuläret för sidan `%1$s` har fler än %2$d grupper"

#. translators: %s: a side's key. Why an AI assistant's change to the store was refused.
#: src/Abilities/SetProductForm.php:273
#, php-format
msgid "a group on side `%s` needs an `id` and its `items`"
msgstr "en grupp på sidan `%s` behöver ett `id` och sina `items`"

#. translators: 1: a group's id; 2: the most items a group keeps. Why an AI assistant's change to the store was refused.
#: src/Abilities/SetProductForm.php:278
#, php-format
msgid "group `%1$s` has more than %2$d items"
msgstr "gruppen `%1$s` har fler än %2$d poster"

#. translators: %s: a group's id. Why an AI assistant's change to the store was refused.
#: src/Abilities/SetProductForm.php:283
#, php-format
msgid "each item of group `%s` names either a `field` or an `attribute`"
msgstr ""
"varje post i gruppen `%s` nämner antingen ett `field` eller ett `attribute`"

#: src/Abilities/SetProductForm.php:309
#: src/Abilities/SetProductSplitListing.php:232
msgid ""
"The product's Pixonaut configuration comes from a newer version of the "
"plugin, so it is not changed. Update the plugin."
msgstr ""
"Produktens Pixonaut-konfiguration kommer från en nyare version av tillägget, "
"så den ändras inte. Uppdatera tillägget."

#. translators: Name of an ability an AI assistant or an MCP client can use on the store.
#: src/Abilities/SetProductPictureView.php:40
msgid "Set what a product image is drawn on"
msgstr "Ange vad en produktbild ritas på"

#: src/Abilities/SetProductPictureView.php:41
msgid ""
"Sets what one Pixonaut image of a personalised product or variation is drawn "
"on: a view of the blank and, of that view, a photo (a scene photo too), as "
"`get-product-picture-views` lists them; neither for the photo the product "
"page starts on; or `kind` `preview` for the flat design. On a product, "
"`showcase` names one of the showcase sets chosen with `set-product-"
"showcase`; without it, the image drawn while no set is chosen. On a "
"variation, it sets the variation's own image, and neither view nor photo "
"makes it follow its product again; a variation is not drawn flat. The "
"pictures are drawn again. The answer is `get-product-picture-views`'."
msgstr ""
"Anger vad en Pixonaut-bild för en personaliserad produkt eller variant ritas "
"på: en vy av grundprodukten och, av den vyn, ett foto (även ett scenfoto), "
"så som `get-product-picture-views` listar dem; ingetdera för fotot som "
"produktsidan visar först; eller `kind` `preview` för den platta designen. "
"För en produkt anger `showcase` ett av exempelseten som valts med `set-"
"product-showcase`; utan det gäller valet bilden som ritas så länge inget set "
"är valt. För en variant anger den variantens egen bild, och varken vy eller "
"foto gör att den åter följer sin produkt; en variant ritas inte platt. "
"Bilderna ritas om. Svaret är detsamma som från `get-product-picture-views`."

#: src/Abilities/SetProductPictureView.php:52
msgid ""
"On a product, one of the showcase sets chosen as its images, by id; left out "
"for the image drawn without a set."
msgstr ""
"För en produkt: ett av exempelseten som valts som dess bilder, angivet med "
"id; utelämnas för bilden som ritas utan set."

#: src/Abilities/SetProductPictureView.php:61
msgid ""
"One of the views `get-product-picture-views` lists; with no photo, its photo "
"of the variant sold."
msgstr ""
"En av vyerna som `get-product-picture-views` listar; utan foto används vyns "
"foto av grundproduktvarianten som säljs."

#: src/Abilities/SetProductPictureView.php:65
msgid ""
"One of the photos `get-product-picture-views` lists; its view is found when "
"left out."
msgstr ""
"Ett av fotona som `get-product-picture-views` listar; dess vy tas fram när "
"den utelämnas."

#: src/Abilities/SetProductPictureView.php:95
msgid ""
"The product is not personalised, so it has no Pixonaut images. Set it up "
"first."
msgstr ""
"Produkten är inte personaliserad, så den har inga Pixonaut-bilder. Ställ in "
"den först."

#: src/Abilities/SetProductPictureView.php:101
msgid ""
"A variation chooses only the view and photo of its own image, or neither to "
"follow its product."
msgstr ""
"En variant väljer bara vy och foto för sin egen bild, eller ingetdera för "
"att följa sin produkt."

#. translators: 1: a showcase set's id; 2: the ids chosen as the product's images, e.g. "graduate, wedding".
#: src/Abilities/SetProductPictureView.php:122
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The product shows no showcase set \"%1$s\": choose it with set-product-"
"showcase first. It shows: %2$s."
msgstr ""
"Produkten visar inget exempelset \"%1$s\": välj det först med set-product-"
"showcase. Den visar: %2$s."

#: src/Abilities/SetProductPictureView.php:124
msgctxt "showcase sets a product shows"
msgid "none"
msgstr "inga"

#: src/Abilities/SetProductPictureView.php:149
msgid ""
"Pixonaut could not be asked for the blank's views and photos. Try again "
"later."
msgstr ""
"Det gick inte att hämta grundproduktens vyer och foton från Pixonaut. Försök "
"igen senare."

#: src/Abilities/SetProductPictureView.php:168
msgid ""
"The product is not on a blank with photos for its side, so its images can "
"only be drawn as the product page shows them, or flat."
msgstr ""
"Produkten ligger inte på en grundprodukt med foton för sin sida, så dess "
"bilder kan bara ritas så som produktsidan visar dem, eller platt."

#. translators: 1: the views of the blank with their photos, e.g. "front (mock-1, mock-2), back (mock-3)".
#: src/Abilities/SetProductPictureView.php:171
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The blank has no such view or photo for the product's side. It has: %1$s."
msgstr ""
"Grundprodukten har ingen sådan vy eller sådant foto för produktens sida. Den "
"har: %1$s."

#. translators: Name of an ability an AI assistant or an MCP client can use on the store.
#: src/Abilities/SetProductPriceChanges.php:45
msgid "Set a product's automatic price changes"
msgstr "Ange en produkts automatiska prisändringar"

#. translators: 1: the name of the ability that changes the pricing settings, 2: the name of the ability that reads a product's prices.
#: src/Abilities/SetProductPriceChanges.php:48
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Says whether the prices of a product printed on a blank change by themselves "
"when a cost changes, whatever the store's switch (`price_automatic`, %1$s) "
"says. `price_changes`: `store` follows the store's switch, `always` has the "
"product's prices that follow the rule set to the rule's price when their "
"cost changes and their margin left the tolerance, also with the store's "
"switch off; `never` only has the new price suggested, also with the switch "
"on. `variations` does the same for single variations, each against its "
"product: `product` follows the product, `always` and `never` answer it. What "
"is left out keeps what it has. It sets no price and reads no cost. Answers "
"what %2$s does: `automatic` and `price_changes` of the product, and of each "
"price."
msgstr ""
"Anger om priserna för en produkt som trycks på en grundprodukt ändras av sig "
"själva när en kostnad ändras, oavsett vad butikens reglage "
"(`price_automatic`, %1$s) anger. `price_changes`: `store` följer butikens "
"reglage; `always` gör att produktens priser som följer regeln sätts till "
"regelns pris när deras kostnad ändras och marginalen ligger utanför "
"toleransen, även när butikens reglage är av; `never` gör att det nya priset "
"bara föreslås, även när reglaget är på. `variations` gör samma sak för "
"enskilda varianter, var och en gentemot sin produkt: `product` följer "
"produkten, `always` och `never` avgör det själva. Det som utelämnas behåller "
"det det har. Den sätter inget pris och hämtar ingen kostnad. Svarar med det "
"som %2$s svarar med: `automatic` och `price_changes` för produkten och för "
"varje pris."

#. translators: 1: the values to choose from, e.g. store, always, never; 2: a product or variation id.
#: src/Abilities/SetProductPriceChanges.php:169
#, php-format
msgid "`price_changes` is one of %1$s for #%2$d."
msgstr "`price_changes` är ett av %1$s för #%2$d."

#. translators: Name of an ability an AI assistant or an MCP client can use on the store.
#: src/Abilities/SetProductSetup.php:53
msgid "Set up a product for Pixonaut"
msgstr "Ställ in en produkt för Pixonaut"

#: src/Abilities/SetProductSetup.php:54
msgid ""
"Sets up a simple or variable product, or one variation, as its Pixonaut tab "
"does: the blank, every side (template, placement, print sizes, start size, "
"form arrangement, personalised or standing), layout, form layout, approval "
"mode, canvas shape, the designer's views, the printshop and the blank "
"variant. A field left out keeps what it has, so read the setup with `list-"
"products` and send what changes. A variation given any setup field gets a "
"setup of its own; `own_setup` false makes it follow its product again. "
"Pixonaut checks the setup; one that fails a check is saved but cannot be "
"bought, and the answer says why."
msgstr ""
"Ställer in en enkel eller variabel produkt, eller en enskild variant, så som "
"dess Pixonaut-flik gör: grundprodukten, varje sida (mall, placering, "
"tryckstorlekar, startstorlek, formulärordning, personaliserad eller fast), "
"layout, formulärlayout, godkännandesätt, designytans form, designverktygets "
"vyer, tryckeriet och grundproduktvarianten. Ett fält som utelämnas behåller "
"sitt värde, så läs inställningarna med `list-products` och skicka det som "
"ändras. En variant som får något inställningsfält får egna inställningar; "
"`own_setup` false gör att den åter följer produktens. Pixonaut kontrollerar "
"inställningarna; en produkt som inte klarar en kontroll sparas men går inte "
"att köpa, och svaret anger varför."

#: src/Abilities/SetProductSetup.php:65
msgid ""
"Whether customers personalise it; false keeps the setup, unused. Left out, "
"true when `sides` are given, else as it is."
msgstr ""
"Om kunder personaliserar den; false behåller inställningarna, oanvända. "
"Utelämnad: true när `sides` anges, annars oförändrad."

#: src/Abilities/SetProductSetup.php:69
msgid ""
"For a variation: true for a setup of its own, false to follow its product's "
"again, keeping its own for later."
msgstr ""
"För en variant: true för egna inställningar, false för att åter följa "
"produktens och spara de egna till senare."

#: src/Abilities/SetProductSetup.php:73
msgid ""
"The blank the design is printed on; empty for a product without a blank, "
"which has one side."
msgstr ""
"Grundprodukten som designen trycks på; tom för en produkt utan grundprodukt, "
"som har en sida."

#: src/Abilities/SetProductSetup.php:77
msgid "Every side, in order; replaces the sides it has."
msgstr "Alla sidor, i ordning; ersätter produktens nuvarande sidor."

#: src/Abilities/SetProductSetup.php:83
msgid "How customers approve their proofs; empty for the store's."
msgstr "Hur kunder godkänner sina korrektur; tom för butikens."

#: src/Abilities/SetProductSetup.php:84
msgid ""
"Where the product's options stand in the form, on a side whose groups were "
"not arranged by hand: `on_top`, unnumbered, or each in a group of its own, "
"`first` or `last`; empty for the store's. A product's only: a variation "
"follows its product."
msgstr ""
"Var produktens alternativ står i formuläret, på en sida vars grupper inte "
"har ordnats för hand: `on_top`, överst och onumrerade, eller vart och ett i "
"en egen grupp, `first` eller `last`; tom för butikens. Gäller bara "
"produkter: en variant följer sin produkt."

#: src/Abilities/SetProductSetup.php:85
msgid ""
"Whether the form numbers its groups; empty for the store's. A product's "
"only: a variation follows its product."
msgstr ""
"Om formuläret numrerar sina grupper; tom för butikens. Gäller bara "
"produkter: en variant följer sin produkt."

#: src/Abilities/SetProductSetup.php:94
msgid "The view the designer starts on, one of `views`; empty for the first."
msgstr "Vyn som designverktyget öppnas på, en av `views`; tom för den första."

#: src/Abilities/SetProductSetup.php:98
msgid ""
"The printshop a product without a blank sends its orders to; empty for the "
"workspace's default."
msgstr ""
"Tryckeriet som en produkt utan grundprodukt skickar sina beställningar till; "
"tom för arbetsytans standardtryckeri."

#: src/Abilities/SetProductSetup.php:102
msgid ""
"For a simple product or a variation on a blank: the blank's variant it "
"sells, by its `v_…` id; empty to match it by the product's options."
msgstr ""
"För en enkel produkt eller en variant på en grundprodukt: "
"grundproduktvarianten som den säljer, angiven med dess `v_…`-id; tom för att "
"matcha den mot produktens attribut."

#: src/Abilities/SetProductSetup.php:136
msgid ""
"A variation follows its product for option_groups and group_numbers: set "
"them on the product."
msgstr ""
"En variant följer sin produkt för option_groups och group_numbers: ange dem "
"på produkten."

#: src/Abilities/SetProductShowcase.php:44
msgid "The sets the product's template offers, by id and name."
msgstr "Seten som produktens mall erbjuder, med id och namn."

#. translators: Name of an ability an AI assistant or an MCP client can use on the store.
#: src/Abilities/SetProductShowcase.php:47
msgid "Set a product's showcase pictures"
msgstr "Välj en produkts exempelbilder"

#. translators: %d: how many showcase pictures a product shows at most, e.g. 10.
#: src/Abilities/SetProductShowcase.php:50
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Sets which of its template's showcase sets a personalised simple or variable "
"product's images are drawn with, in order, up to %d; replaces the ones it "
"has, and an empty list removes them. Each is drawn on the blank's photo "
"(`mockup`) or as the flat design (`preview`); a product without a blank has "
"only the flat design. The pictures are drawn again. The answer lists the "
"sets the template offers."
msgstr ""
"Anger vilka av mallens exempelset som bilderna för en personaliserad enkel "
"eller variabel produkt ritas med, i ordning, upp till %d; ersätter de "
"nuvarande, och en tom lista tar bort dem. Varje set ritas på grundproduktens "
"foto (`mockup`) eller som platt design (`preview`); en produkt utan "
"grundprodukt har bara den platta designen. Bilderna ritas om. Svaret listar "
"seten som mallen erbjuder."

#: src/Abilities/SetProductShowcase.php:68
msgid "One of the template's showcase sets, by id."
msgstr "Ett av mallens exempelset, angivet med id."

#: src/Abilities/SetProductShowcase.php:106
msgid ""
"The product is not personalised with a template, so it has no showcase sets. "
"Set it up first."
msgstr ""
"Produkten är inte personaliserad med en mall, så den har inga exempelset. "
"Ställ in den först."

#: src/Abilities/SetProductShowcase.php:111
msgid ""
"Pixonaut could not be asked for the template's showcase sets. Try again "
"later."
msgstr ""
"Det gick inte att hämta mallens exempelset från Pixonaut. Försök igen senare."

#. translators: 1: a showcase set's id; 2: the ids the template offers, e.g. "graduate, wedding".
#: src/Abilities/SetProductShowcase.php:125
#, php-format
msgid "The template has no showcase set \"%1$s\". It has: %2$s."
msgstr "Mallen har inget exempelset \"%1$s\". Den har: %2$s."

#: src/Abilities/SetProductShowcase.php:127
msgctxt "showcase sets a template offers"
msgid "none"
msgstr "inga"

#. translators: Name of an ability an AI assistant or an MCP client can use on the store.
#: src/Abilities/SetProductSplitListing.php:55
msgid "Set which values a product lists as their own products"
msgstr "Ange vilka av en produkts värden som visas som egna produkter"

#: src/Abilities/SetProductSplitListing.php:56
msgid ""
"Sets, for each global attribute of a simple or variable product listed, its "
"\"Cards in the shop\" choice (`on`, a card per value always; `filtered`, a "
"card per value only while a filter of the shop chooses one, as for a "
"framing; `off`, none; or `auto` to follow the attribute's own setting, which "
"`set-attribute-split-listing` sets) and each listed value's card's own title "
"and image, as the product's Attributes tab does. `cards` sets the title and "
"image of the cards named by their values' `term_ids`: one of a product "
"listed by several attributes is a combination, one value of each, as `get-"
"product-split-listing` lists them. Give `attributes`, `cards` or both. Only "
"what is given changes: an attribute, value, card, title or image left out "
"keeps what it has. An empty title or a null image gives the card the "
"product's own again. Nothing is saved unless everything listed fits. An "
"image given by `src` is copied after the call has answered: until then the "
"card keeps the image it had, and its `image_copy` says it is waiting, or why "
"the copy failed. The answer is what the product has now, as `get-product-"
"split-listing` gives it."
msgstr ""
"Anger, för varje listat globalt attribut hos en enkel eller variabel "
"produkt, dess val för \"Kort i butiken\" (`on`, alltid ett kort per värde; "
"`filtered`, ett kort per värde bara när ett filter i butiken väljer ett, som "
"för en inramning; `off`, inga; eller `auto` för att följa attributets egen "
"inställning, som `set-attribute-split-listing` anger) och den egna titeln "
"och bilden på varje listat värdes kort, på samma sätt som produktens flik "
"Attribut. `cards` anger titel och bild för de kort som pekas ut med sina "
"värdens `term_ids`: på en produkt som visas uppdelad efter flera attribut är "
"ett kort en kombination, ett värde för varje attribut, så som `get-product-"
"split-listing` listar dem. Ange `attributes`, `cards` eller båda. Bara det "
"som anges ändras: ett attribut, ett värde, ett kort, en titel eller en bild "
"som utelämnas förblir som det är. En tom titel eller en bild som är null ger "
"kortet produktens titel eller bild igen. Ingenting sparas om inte allt som "
"listas är giltigt. En bild som anges med `src` kopieras efter att anropet "
"har besvarats: tills dess behåller kortet den bild det hade, och dess "
"`image_copy` anger att det väntar, eller varför kopieringen misslyckades. "
"Svaret är det som produkten har nu, så som `get-product-split-listing` ger "
"det."

#: src/Abilities/SetProductSplitListing.php:73
msgid "One of the product's global attributes, by id."
msgstr "Ett av produktens globala attribut, angivet med id."

#: src/Abilities/SetProductSplitListing.php:88
msgid "One of the values the product has of the attribute, by its term id."
msgstr "Ett av produktens värden för attributet, angivet med dess term-id."

#: src/Abilities/SetProductSplitListing.php:92
#: src/Abilities/SetProductSplitListing.php:123
msgid "The card's own title; empty for the product's."
msgstr "Kortets egen titel; tom för produktens."

#: src/Abilities/SetProductSplitListing.php:115
msgid ""
"The card's values, by term id: values the product has, at most one of an "
"attribute, in any order."
msgstr ""
"Kortets värden, angivna med term-id: värden som produkten har, högst ett per "
"attribut, i valfri ordning."

#: src/Abilities/SetProductSplitListing.php:155
msgid ""
"The card's own image: `id`, an image of the media library, or `src`, a "
"public URL the store copies into it after the call has answered; null for "
"the value's picture or the product's. A card the shop lists without a filter "
"shows the Pixonaut picture of its design, the template alone, over its own "
"image once that picture is drawn."
msgstr ""
"Kortets egen bild: `id`, en bild i mediabiblioteket, eller `src`, en "
"offentlig URL som butiken kopierar in dit efter att anropet har besvarats; "
"null för värdets bild eller produktens. Ett kort som butiken visar utan "
"filter visar Pixonaut-bilden av designen, bara mallen, i stället för sin "
"egen bild när den bilden har ritats."

#: src/Abilities/SetProductSplitListing.php:248
msgid "Give `attributes`, `cards` or both."
msgstr "Ange `attributes`, `cards` eller båda."

#. translators: %d: an attribute's id. Why an AI assistant's change to the store was refused.
#: src/Abilities/SetProductSplitListing.php:259
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The product has no global attribute %d. Only a global attribute's values can "
"be listed as their own products."
msgstr ""
"Produkten har inget globalt attribut %d. Bara ett globalt attributs värden "
"kan visas som egna produkter."

#. translators: %d: an attribute's id. Why an AI assistant's change to the store was refused.
#: src/Abilities/SetProductSplitListing.php:263
#, php-format
msgid "Attribute %d is listed twice."
msgstr "Attribut %d finns med två gånger."

#. translators: %s: a card's values' term ids, e.g. "12,15". Why an AI assistant's change to the store was refused.
#: src/Abilities/SetProductSplitListing.php:282
#, php-format
msgid "Card %s is listed twice."
msgstr "Kort %s finns med två gånger."

#. translators: 1: a value's term id; 2: an attribute's id. Why an AI assistant's change to the store was refused.
#: src/Abilities/SetProductSplitListing.php:311
#, php-format
msgid "The product has no value %1$d of attribute %2$d."
msgstr "Produkten har inget värde %1$d för attribut %2$d."

#. translators: %d: a value's term id. Why an AI assistant's change to the store was refused.
#: src/Abilities/SetProductSplitListing.php:315
#, php-format
msgid "Value %d is listed twice."
msgstr "Värde %d finns med två gånger."

#. translators: %d: a value's term id. Why an AI assistant's change to the store was refused.
#: src/Abilities/SetProductSplitListing.php:350
#, php-format
msgid "The product has no value %d of a global attribute."
msgstr "Produkten har inget värde %d för något globalt attribut."

#. translators: 1, 2: two values' term ids; 3: an attribute's id. Why an AI assistant's change to the store was refused.
#: src/Abilities/SetProductSplitListing.php:354
#, php-format
msgid ""
"A card takes one value of an attribute: %1$d and %2$d are both of attribute "
"%3$d."
msgstr ""
"Ett kort har ett värde per attribut: %1$d och %2$d hör båda till attribut "
"%3$d."

#: src/Abilities/SetProductSplitListing.php:359
msgid "Name a card by at least one of its values."
msgstr "Peka ut ett kort med minst ett av dess värden."

#. translators: %s: a card's values' term ids, e.g. "12" or "12,15". Why an AI assistant's change to the store was refused.
#: src/Abilities/SetProductSplitListing.php:402
#, php-format
msgid "Give the image of card %s as either `id` or `src`."
msgstr "Ange bilden för kort %s antingen som `id` eller som `src`."

#. translators: %d: an attachment's id. Why an AI assistant's change to the store was refused.
#: src/Abilities/SetProductSplitListing.php:407
#, php-format
msgid "The media library has no image %d."
msgstr "Mediabiblioteket har ingen bild med id %d."

#. translators: %s: a card's values' term ids, e.g. "12" or "12,15". Why an AI assistant's change to the store was refused.
#: src/Abilities/SetProductSplitListing.php:413
#, php-format
msgid "The image of card %s is not a public URL."
msgstr "Bilden för kort %s är ingen offentlig URL."

#. translators: Name of an ability an AI assistant or an MCP client can use on the store.
#: src/Abilities/SetShippingMethod.php:80
msgid "Change or add a shipping method"
msgstr "Ändra eller lägg till ett leveranssätt"

#. translators: %s: the name of the ability that reads the shipping zones.
#: src/Abilities/SetShippingMethod.php:83
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Changes a shipping method in a zone, by its `instance_id` as %s reads it, or "
"without one adds a flat rate or free shipping (`kind`) to the zone. Only the "
"settings given change. `cost` is a flat rate's or pickup's cost, kept "
"excluding tax; with `cost_includes_tax` it is what shoppers at the store's "
"address pay including the shipping tax, and the cost kept is counted from "
"it. `min_amount` is free shipping's minimum order amount, which WooCommerce "
"checks against the cart's subtotal as the cart shows it, after coupon "
"discounts unless `ignore_discounts`; given a minimum, free shipping that "
"required nothing comes to require it. `enabled` false takes a method away "
"from checkout without deleting it. Answers the method as it is now."
msgstr ""
"Ändrar ett leveranssätt i en zon, utifrån dess `instance_id` så som %s läser "
"det, eller lägger utan ett sådant till fast pris eller gratis frakt (`kind`) "
"i zonen. Bara de inställningar som anges ändras. `cost` är kostnaden för "
"fast pris eller hämta själv, lagrad exklusive moms; med `cost_includes_tax` "
"är den vad kunder på butikens adress betalar inklusive momsen på frakten, "
"och den lagrade kostnaden räknas fram ur den. `min_amount` är lägsta "
"beställningsbelopp för gratis frakt, som WooCommerce jämför med varukorgens "
"delsumma så som varukorgen visar den, efter rabatter från rabattkoder utom "
"med `ignore_discounts`; anges ett lägsta belopp kommer gratis frakt som inte "
"krävde något att kräva det. `enabled` false tar bort ett leveranssätt från "
"kassan utan att radera det. Svaret är leveranssättet som det är nu."

#: src/Abilities/SetShippingMethod.php:92 src/Abilities/ShippingMethods.php:209
msgid "The zone; 0 is the zone for the locations no other zone covers."
msgstr "Zonen; 0 är zonen för de platser som ingen annan zon omfattar."

#: src/Abilities/SetShippingMethod.php:97
msgid "The method to change; leave it out to add one."
msgstr "Leveranssättet som ska ändras; utelämna det för att lägga till ett."

#: src/Abilities/SetShippingMethod.php:102
msgid "The kind of method to add."
msgstr "Typen av leveranssätt som ska läggas till."

#: src/Abilities/SetShippingMethod.php:124
msgid "Empty for no minimum."
msgstr "Tomt när det inte finns något lägsta belopp."

#: src/Abilities/SetShippingMethod.php:134
msgid ""
"The method's place among the zone's methods, lowest first. A method already "
"at that place, and those after it, move one place down; the others keep "
"theirs. A cart that starts qualifying for another rate gets the first one it "
"can have that is not pickup, so free shipping that is to be chosen once a "
"cart reaches its minimum goes before a flat rate."
msgstr ""
"Leveranssättets plats bland zonens leveranssätt, lägst först. Ett "
"leveranssätt som redan har den platsen, och de efter det, flyttas ett steg "
"ned; de andra behåller sina. En varukorg som börjar uppfylla villkoren för "
"en annan fraktkostnad får den första den kan få som inte är hämta själv, så "
"gratis frakt som ska väljas när en varukorg når sitt lägsta belopp läggs "
"före fast pris."

#: src/Abilities/SetShippingMethod.php:163
msgid "No shipping method has this instance id."
msgstr "Inget leveranssätt har detta instans-id."

#: src/Abilities/SetShippingMethod.php:167
msgid "Give the method's instance_id to change it, or a kind to add one."
msgstr ""
"Ange leveranssättets instance_id för att ändra det, eller en typ (kind) för "
"att lägga till ett."

#: src/Abilities/SetShippingMethod.php:170
msgid "A method's kind cannot change: add a method of the other kind instead."
msgstr ""
"Ett leveranssätts typ kan inte ändras: lägg i stället till ett leveranssätt "
"av den andra typen."

#. translators: 1: a setting's key, e.g. min_amount; 2: a kind of shipping method, e.g. flat_rate.
#. translators: 1: a setting's key, e.g. title; 2: a kind of shipping method, e.g. flat_rate.
#: src/Abilities/SetShippingMethod.php:175
#: src/Abilities/SetShippingMethod.php:192
#, php-format
msgid "A %2$s method has no setting %1$s."
msgstr "Ett leveranssätt av typen %2$s har ingen inställning %1$s."

#: src/Abilities/SetShippingMethod.php:210
msgid "The store did not keep the shipping method."
msgstr "Butiken sparade inte leveranssättet."

#: src/Abilities/SetShippingMethod.php:294
msgid ""
"Shipping is taxed as the cart's items are, and the store's taxable products "
"have different rates, so a cost including tax depends on the cart. Give the "
"cost excluding tax, or set a shipping tax class in WooCommerce's tax "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"Frakt beskattas som varukorgens artiklar, och butikens momsbelagda produkter "
"har olika momssatser, så en kostnad inklusive moms beror på varukorgen. Ange "
"kostnaden exklusive moms, eller välj en momsklass för frakt i WooCommerces "
"momsinställningar."

#: src/Abilities/SetupFields.php:165
msgid ""
"The side's key, unique on the product, e.g. `front`; left out for one made "
"from the placement."
msgstr ""
"Sidans nyckel, unik på produkten, t.ex. `front`; utelämnas för en nyckel som "
"bildas från placeringen."

#: src/Abilities/SetupFields.php:170
msgid ""
"The name customers see, e.g. \"Front\"; left out for the placement's or the "
"template's name."
msgstr ""
"Namnet som kunderna ser, t.ex. \"Framsida\"; utelämnas för placeringens "
"eller mallens namn."

#: src/Abilities/SetupFields.php:175
msgid ""
"The template, as the template list gives it: a version such as `mini-tee@2`, "
"or the id alone (`mini-tee`) for its live version. The side follows the "
"template's latest published version from then on, unless `template_pinned` "
"is true."
msgstr ""
"Mallen, så som mallistan anger den: en version som `mini-tee@2`, eller bara "
"id:t (`mini-tee`) för dess aktiva version. Sidan följer därefter mallens "
"senast publicerade version, om inte `template_pinned` är true."

#: src/Abilities/SetupFields.php:179
msgid ""
"True to keep the side on the version `template_id` gives when a new version "
"is published; false or left out to follow the latest."
msgstr ""
"True för att sidan ska stanna på versionen som `template_id` anger när en ny "
"version publiceras; false eller utelämnad för att följa den senaste."

#: src/Abilities/SetupFields.php:184
msgid ""
"Where on the blank it is printed; needed with a blank, ignored without one."
msgstr ""
"Var på grundprodukten den trycks; krävs med en grundprodukt, ignoreras utan."

#: src/Abilities/SetupFields.php:188
msgid ""
"`personalised` when the customer fills in the template, `standing` when the "
"template is printed as its author left it, from one design for every sale."
msgstr ""
"`personalised` när kunden fyller i mallen, `standing` när mallen trycks så "
"som skaparen lämnade den, från en och samma design vid varje försäljning."

#: src/Abilities/SetupFields.php:194
msgid ""
"The sizes customers choose between, in millimetres, in order; empty or left "
"out for the placement's default size. An entry with `placement_default` true "
"is that default size. Without a blank, each must match the template's aspect "
"ratio."
msgstr ""
"Storlekarna som kunderna väljer mellan, i millimeter, i ordning; tom eller "
"utelämnad för placeringens standardstorlek. En post med `placement_default` "
"true är den standardstorleken. Utan grundprodukt måste var och en stämma med "
"mallens bildförhållande."

#: src/Abilities/SetupFields.php:209 src/Abilities/SetVariationPrintSize.php:92
msgid "The name customers see, e.g. \"A3\"; left out for the millimetres."
msgstr ""
"Namnet som kunderna ser, t.ex. \"A3\"; utelämnas för att visa måtten i "
"millimeter."

#: src/Abilities/SetupFields.php:213
msgid "The placement's default size; its width and height are then ignored."
msgstr "Placeringens standardstorlek; postens bredd och höjd ignoreras då."

#: src/Abilities/SetupFields.php:220
msgid ""
"The size the designer starts on, by its place in `print_sizes` from 0. A "
"standing side is printed at it."
msgstr ""
"Storleken som designverktyget startar med, angiven med dess plats i "
"`print_sizes` från 0. En fast sida trycks i den storleken."

#: src/Abilities/SetupFields.php:226
msgid ""
"How the designer's form is arranged on the product page, as `list-products` "
"gives it: `{groups: [{id, title, items}]}`, an item being `{field: "
"\"<layerId>:<prop>\", label, help, placeholder, options}` or `{attribute: "
"<attribute slug>}`. Null or left out for the template's own."
msgstr ""
"Hur designverktygets formulär är ordnat på produktsidan, så som `list-"
"products` anger det: `{groups: [{id, title, items}]}`, där en post är "
"`{field: \"<layerId>:<prop>\", label, help, placeholder, options}` eller "
"`{attribute: <attribute slug>}`. Null eller utelämnad för mallens egen "
"ordning."

#: src/Abilities/SetupFields.php:228
msgid "empty or left out for the product's choice"
msgstr "tom eller utelämnad för produktens val"

#. translators: %s: what the empty choice follows, e.g. "empty for the template's own setting".
#: src/Abilities/SetupFields.php:245
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The shape customers design on when a print size's proportions are not the "
"template's: `template` keeps the template's shape at every size, and the "
"print is cropped to the size as the template fits it; `print_size` changes "
"shape with each size; %s."
msgstr ""
"Formen på ytan som kunderna designar på när en tryckstorleks proportioner "
"inte är mallens: `template` behåller mallens form i alla storlekar, och "
"trycket beskärs till storleken på samma sätt som mallen anpassas till den; "
"`print_size` ändrar form med varje storlek; %s."

#: src/Abilities/SetupFields.php:268
msgid ""
"Pixonaut could not be asked for the template's live version. Give the "
"version, as the template list gives it, or try again later."
msgstr ""
"Det gick inte att hämta mallens aktiva version från Pixonaut. Ange "
"versionen, så som mallistan anger den, eller försök igen senare."

#. translators: %s: a template's id, e.g. "mini-tee".
#: src/Abilities/SetupFields.php:274
#, php-format
msgid "No live template has the id \"%s\"."
msgstr "Ingen aktiv mall har id:t \"%s\"."

#. translators: Name of an ability an AI assistant or an MCP client can use on the store.
#: src/Abilities/SetVariationPictures.php:49
msgid "Change the picture for every variation setting"
msgstr "Ändra inställningen för variantbilder"

#. translators: %s: the name of the ability that reads the setting.
#: src/Abilities/SetVariationPictures.php:52
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Turns drawing a Pixonaut picture for every variation on or off, store-wide "
"(`choice` `on` or `off`) or for a variable product (`default` follows the "
"store-wide setting). Read %s first and tell the store manager what it costs: "
"turning it on draws one picture per variant into the shop's own media "
"library. When its `warning` applies, turning it on is refused unless "
"`confirm` is true, which only the store manager may decide. Turning it off "
"deletes the variation pictures nothing else uses. Answers with the setting "
"as it is now and `changed`, what the change costs."
msgstr ""
"Slår på eller av att en Pixonaut-bild ritas för varje variant, för hela "
"butiken (`choice` `on` eller `off`) eller för en variabel produkt (`default` "
"följer butiksinställningen). Läs %s först och berätta för butiksägaren vad "
"det kostar: när inställningen slås på ritas en bild per grundproduktvariant "
"in i butikens eget mediabibliotek. När dess `warning` gäller avvisas "
"påslagningen om inte `confirm` är true, och det får bara butiksägaren "
"bestämma. När inställningen stängs av tas de variantbilder bort som inget "
"annat använder. Svarar med inställningen som den är nu och `changed`, vad "
"ändringen kostar."

#: src/Abilities/SetVariationPictures.php:62
msgid "`on` or `off`; for a product also `default`, the store-wide setting."
msgstr "`on` eller `off`; för en produkt även `default`, butiksinställningen."

#: src/Abilities/SetVariationPictures.php:66
msgid "The store manager accepts the warning about the shop's storage."
msgstr "Butiksägaren accepterar varningen om butikens lagringsutrymme."

#: src/Abilities/SetVariationPictures.php:104
msgid "The store-wide setting is on or off; a product's is default, on or off."
msgstr ""
"Butiksinställningen är on eller off; en produkts är default, on eller off."

#: src/Abilities/SetVariationPictures.php:109
msgid ""
"Nothing was changed. Tell the store manager, and call again with confirm "
"true only if they accept it."
msgstr ""
"Ingenting ändrades. Berätta det för butiksägaren och anropa igen med confirm "
"true bara om butiksägaren accepterar det."

#. translators: Name of an ability an AI assistant or an MCP client can use on the store.
#: src/Abilities/SetVariationPrintSize.php:73
msgid "Set a variation's print size"
msgstr "Ange en variants tryckstorlek"

#: src/Abilities/SetVariationPrintSize.php:74
msgid ""
"Gives one variation its own print size, in millimetres, on a product with or "
"without a blank: the variation gets a setup of its own, starting from the "
"one it has, whose one side is sold in that size alone. Pixonaut checks the "
"size as the variation's Pixonaut panel does; a size it cannot print is "
"refused with the reason, and nothing is saved. On a blank whose print areas "
"change with an option, the size is checked against the print area of the "
"variation's blank variant. With `clear` true and no size, takes the "
"variation's own size off instead: it is sold at its placement's size again, "
"its blank variant's print area where those change with an option. The answer "
"gives the variation's validity and blank variant now."
msgstr ""
"Ger en variant en egen tryckstorlek, i millimeter, på en produkt med eller "
"utan grundprodukt: varianten får egna inställningar, utifrån dem den har, "
"där dess enda sida säljs i bara den storleken. Pixonaut kontrollerar "
"storleken på samma sätt som variantens Pixonaut-panel gör; en storlek som "
"inte går att trycka avvisas med orsaken, och ingenting sparas. På en "
"grundprodukt vars tryckytor ändras med ett alternativ kontrolleras storleken "
"mot tryckytan för variantens grundproduktvariant. Med `clear` true och ingen "
"storlek tas variantens egen storlek i stället bort: den säljs då åter i sin "
"placerings storlek, eller i tryckytan för sin grundproduktvariant där "
"tryckytorna ändras med ett alternativ. Svaret anger variantens giltighet och "
"grundproduktvariant efter ändringen."

#: src/Abilities/SetVariationPrintSize.php:96
msgid ""
"True, in place of `width_mm` and `height_mm`, to take the variation's own "
"print size off."
msgstr ""
"True, i stället för `width_mm` och `height_mm`, för att ta bort variantens "
"egen tryckstorlek."

#: src/Abilities/SetVariationPrintSize.php:107
#: src/Abilities/SetVariationVariants.php:108
msgid ""
"The blank's variant the variation sells; null when it is not personalised on "
"a blank."
msgstr ""
"Grundproduktvarianten som varianten säljer; null när den inte är "
"personaliserad på en grundprodukt."

#: src/Abilities/SetVariationPrintSize.php:137
msgid "No variation has this id."
msgstr "Ingen variant har detta id."

#: src/Abilities/SetVariationPrintSize.php:143
msgid "Give a size or `clear`, not both."
msgstr "Ange en storlek eller `clear`, inte båda."

#: src/Abilities/SetVariationPrintSize.php:157
msgid ""
"The variation has several sides, each with its own print sizes: set them "
"with set-product-setup."
msgstr ""
"Varianten har flera sidor, var och en med egna tryckstorlekar: ange dem med "
"set-product-setup."

#: src/Abilities/SetVariationPrintSize.php:161
msgid ""
"The variation is not personalised with a template. Link its product first."
msgstr ""
"Varianten är inte personaliserad med en mall. Länka först dess produkt till "
"en mall."

#: src/Abilities/SetVariationPrintSize.php:164
msgid ""
"The variation has a setup of its own without a blank, so there is no "
"placement whose size it could take: give it a size, or make it follow its "
"product again with set-product-setup."
msgstr ""
"Varianten har egna inställningar utan grundprodukt, så det finns ingen "
"placering vars storlek den kan få: ge den en storlek, eller låt den följa "
"sin produkt igen med set-product-setup."

#. translators: Name of an ability an AI assistant or an MCP client can use on the store.
#: src/Abilities/SetVariationVariants.php:56
msgid "Set the blank variant of variations"
msgstr "Ange grundproduktvarianten för varianter"

#: src/Abilities/SetVariationVariants.php:57
msgid ""
"Sets which variant of its blank each listed variation of a variable product "
"is printed as, by the variant's options, as picking it in the variation's "
"Pixonaut panel does. Nothing is saved unless every variation listed names "
"exactly one variant that is still sold. The answer gives every variation of "
"the product with the variant it sells now."
msgstr ""
"Anger vilken grundproduktvariant varje listad variant av en variabel produkt "
"trycks som, utifrån grundproduktvariantens alternativ, på samma sätt som när "
"den väljs i variantens Pixonaut-panel. Ingenting sparas om inte varje listad "
"variant motsvarar exakt en grundproduktvariant som fortfarande säljs. Svaret "
"ger alla produktens varianter med den grundproduktvariant som var och en "
"säljer nu."

#: src/Abilities/SetVariationVariants.php:78
msgid ""
"The variant's option values by axis, e.g. `{\"Size\": \"M\"}`, as Pixonaut "
"writes them or as the variation's Pixonaut panel shows them; every axis of "
"the variant and no other. Empty for a blank without options."
msgstr ""
"Grundproduktvariantens alternativvärden per dimension, t.ex. `{\"Size\": "
"\"M\"}`, så som Pixonaut skriver dem eller som variantens Pixonaut-panel "
"visar dem; alla grundproduktvariantens dimensioner och inga andra. Tomt för "
"en grundprodukt utan alternativ."

#: src/Abilities/SetVariationVariants.php:96
msgid ""
"Whether customers can buy the product now, its blank variants and "
"WooCommerce's own checks included."
msgstr ""
"Om kunder kan köpa produkten nu, med grundproduktvarianterna och "
"WooCommerces egna kontroller medräknade."

#: src/Abilities/SetVariationVariants.php:100
msgid ""
"Which of the product's variations sell no variant of the blank, in words; "
"null when each does."
msgstr ""
"Vilka av produktens varianter som inte säljer någon grundproduktvariant, i "
"ord; null när alla gör det."

#: src/Abilities/SetVariationVariants.php:131
#: src/Abilities/VariationPlanRows.php:39 src/Admin/VariationPlanPanel.php:97
msgid "No variable product has this id."
msgstr "Ingen variabel produkt har detta id."

#. translators: %d: a variation's id. Why an AI assistant's change to the store was refused.
#: src/Abilities/SetVariationVariants.php:166
#, php-format
msgid "Variation %d is listed twice."
msgstr "Variant %d finns med två gånger."

#. translators: 1: a variation's id; 2: a product's id. Why an AI assistant's change to the store was refused.
#: src/Abilities/SetVariationVariants.php:172
#, php-format
msgid "Variation %1$d is not a variation of product %2$d."
msgstr "Variant %1$d är inte en variant av produkt %2$d."

#. translators: %d: a variation's id. Why an AI assistant's change to the store was refused.
#: src/Abilities/SetVariationVariants.php:177
#, php-format
msgid "Variation %d is not personalised on a blank."
msgstr "Variant %d är inte personaliserad på en grundprodukt."

#. translators: %d: a variation's id. Why an AI assistant's change to the store was refused.
#: src/Abilities/SetVariationVariants.php:211
#, php-format
msgid "The options of variation %d name no variant of its blank."
msgstr "Alternativen för variant %d motsvarar ingen grundproduktvariant."

#. translators: %d: a variation's id. Why an AI assistant's change to the store was refused.
#: src/Abilities/SetVariationVariants.php:215
#, php-format
msgid "The options of variation %d name several variants of its blank."
msgstr "Alternativen för variant %d motsvarar flera grundproduktvarianter."

#. translators: %d: a variation's id. Why an AI assistant's change to the store was refused.
#: src/Abilities/SetVariationVariants.php:219
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The options of variation %d name a variant of its blank that is retired."
msgstr ""
"Alternativen för variant %d motsvarar en grundproduktvariant som har utgått."

#: src/Abilities/ShippingMethods.php:221
msgid "country, state, postcode or continent."
msgstr "country, state, postcode eller continent."

#: src/Abilities/ShippingMethods.php:247
msgid "flat_rate, free_shipping, local_pickup, or another plugin's method."
msgstr ""
"flat_rate, free_shipping, local_pickup eller ett annat tilläggs leveranssätt."

#: src/Abilities/ShippingMethods.php:251
msgid "What shoppers see the method as at checkout."
msgstr "Namnet som kunder ser leveranssättet under i kassan."

#: src/Abilities/ShippingMethods.php:257
msgid ""
"A flat rate's or pickup's cost as WooCommerce keeps it, excluding tax; it "
"may be a formula such as `10 + [qty] * 2`. Empty for nothing, null for a "
"method without a cost."
msgstr ""
"Kostnaden för fast pris eller hämta själv så som WooCommerce lagrar den, "
"exklusive moms; den kan vara en formel som `10 + [qty] * 2`. Tom när det "
"inte kostar något, null för ett leveranssätt utan kostnad."

#: src/Abilities/ShippingMethods.php:261
msgid ""
"The cost as shoppers at the store's address pay it, with the shipping tax "
"when the method is taxable. Null for a formula, a method without a cost, or "
"when shipping is taxed as the cart's items are and the store's taxable "
"products have different rates, so the tax depends on the cart."
msgstr ""
"Kostnaden så som kunder på butikens adress betalar den, med momsen på "
"frakten när leveranssättet är momsbelagt. Null för en formel, för ett "
"leveranssätt utan kostnad, eller när frakt beskattas som varukorgens "
"artiklar och butikens momsbelagda produkter har olika momssatser, så att "
"momsen beror på varukorgen."

#: src/Abilities/ShippingMethods.php:265
msgid "taxable or none; null for a method without a cost."
msgstr "taxable eller none; null för ett leveranssätt utan kostnad."

#: src/Abilities/ShippingMethods.php:269
msgid ""
"Free shipping's minimum order amount, empty for none; null for another "
"method."
msgstr ""
"Lägsta beställningsbelopp för gratis frakt, tomt när det inte finns något; "
"null för andra leveranssätt."

#: src/Abilities/ShippingMethods.php:273
msgid ""
"What free shipping requires: empty for nothing, coupon, min_amount, either "
"(a coupon or the minimum) or both; null for another method."
msgstr ""
"Vad gratis frakt kräver: tomt för inget, coupon, min_amount, either (en "
"rabattkod eller lägsta beloppet) eller both; null för andra leveranssätt."

#: src/Abilities/ShippingMethods.php:277
msgid ""
"Whether free shipping's minimum counts the subtotal before coupon discounts; "
"null for another method."
msgstr ""
"Om lägsta beloppet för gratis frakt räknas på delsumman före rabatter från "
"rabattkoder; null för andra leveranssätt."

#. translators: Name of an ability an AI assistant or an MCP client can use on the store.
#: src/Abilities/Store/DescribeResource.php:56
msgid "Describe a kind of thing in the store"
msgstr "Beskriv en typ av objekt i butiken"

#: src/Abilities/Store/DescribeResource.php:57
msgid ""
"Gives the fields a create or an update of one kind of thing in the store "
"takes, as this store's REST route describes them: each field's type, "
"description and allowed values."
msgstr ""
"Anger vilka fält som krävs för att skapa eller uppdatera en typ av objekt i "
"butiken, så som butikens REST-route beskriver dem: varje fälts typ, "
"beskrivning och tillåtna värden."

#: src/Abilities/Store/DescribeResource.php:75
msgid "The REST route a create, or else an update, runs through."
msgstr "REST-routen som skapandet, eller annars uppdateringen, går via."

#: src/Abilities/Store/DescribeResource.php:79
msgid "Each writable field's JSON schema, by its name."
msgstr "Varje skrivbart fälts JSON-schema, efter fältets namn."

#: src/Abilities/Store/DescribeResource.php:120
msgid "The store has no such kind of thing."
msgstr "Butiken har ingen sådan typ av objekt."

#. translators: %s: the input fields a store ability needs, e.g. "product_id, id".
#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:159
#, php-format
msgid "Name %s."
msgstr "Ange %s."

#. translators: %s: a kind of thing in the store, plural, e.g. "product categories". Name of an ability an AI assistant or an MCP client can use on the store.
#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:247
#, php-format
msgid "List %s"
msgstr "Lista %s"

#. translators: %s: a kind of thing in the store, e.g. "product category". Name of an ability an AI assistant or an MCP client can use on the store.
#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:249
#, php-format
msgid "Read %s"
msgstr "Visa %s"

#. translators: %s: a kind of thing in the store, e.g. "product category". Name of an ability an AI assistant or an MCP client can use on the store.
#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:251
#, php-format
msgid "Create %s"
msgstr "Skapa %s"

#. translators: %s: a kind of thing in the store, e.g. "product category", or several, e.g. "shipping zone locations". Name of an ability an AI assistant or an MCP client can use on the store.
#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:253
#, php-format
msgid "Update %s"
msgstr "Uppdatera %s"

#. translators: %s: a kind of thing in the store, e.g. "product category". Name of an ability an AI assistant or an MCP client can use on the store.
#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:255
#, php-format
msgid "Delete %s"
msgstr "Ta bort %s"

#. translators: 1: a few field names, e.g. "name, slug, parent"; 2: the name of the ability that describes every field.
#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:264
#, php-format
msgid "Fields include %1$s; %2$s gives every field."
msgstr "Fälten omfattar bland annat %1$s; %2$s anger alla fält."

#. translators: 1: a kind of thing in the store, plural, e.g. "product categories"; 2: a REST API route.
#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:270
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Lists the store's %1$s through the REST route %2$s. `query` takes the "
"route's query parameters, e.g. search, page, per_page, and _fields to read "
"only some fields."
msgstr ""
"Listar butikens %1$s via REST-routen %2$s. `query` tar emot routens "
"frågeparametrar, t.ex. search, page, per_page, och _fields för att bara läsa "
"vissa fält."

#. translators: 1: a kind of thing in the store, plural, e.g. "product categories"; 2: a REST API route.
#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:272
#, php-format
msgid "Reads one of the store's %1$s by its id through the REST route %2$s."
msgstr "Läser en av butikens %1$s utifrån dess id via REST-routen %2$s."

#. translators: 1: a kind of thing in the store, plural, e.g. "product categories"; 2: a REST API route.
#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:274
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Creates one of the store's %1$s through the REST route %2$s, with `fields` "
"as the route takes them."
msgstr ""
"Skapar en ny bland butikens %1$s via REST-routen %2$s, med `fields` i den "
"form routen tar emot dem."

#. translators: 1: a kind of thing in the store, plural, e.g. "shipping zone locations"; 2: a REST API route.
#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:277
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Replaces the %1$s through the REST route %2$s with `items`, the whole new "
"list: what it leaves out is removed."
msgstr ""
"Ersätter %1$s via REST-routen %2$s med `items`, hela den nya listan: det som "
"utelämnas tas bort."

#. translators: 1: a kind of thing in the store, plural, e.g. "product categories"; 2: a REST API route.
#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:279
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Changes one of the store's %1$s through the REST route %2$s, with only the "
"`fields` to change."
msgstr ""
"Ändrar en av butikens %1$s via REST-routen %2$s, med bara de `fields` som "
"ska ändras."

#. translators: 1: a kind of thing in the store, plural, e.g. "product categories"; 2: a REST API route.
#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:281
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Deletes one of the store's %1$s through the REST route %2$s. With `force` it "
"is deleted for good where the route would otherwise move it to the trash."
msgstr ""
"Tar bort en av butikens %1$s via REST-routen %2$s. Med `force` raderas den "
"permanent där routen annars skulle flytta den till papperskorgen."

#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:284
msgid "The store downloads the file from `fields.source_url`, a public URL."
msgstr "Butiken laddar ner filen från `fields.source_url`, en offentlig URL."

#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:290
msgid ""
"Each variation also gives `pixonaut_variant`, the variant of its blank it is "
"printed as: `ref` null and `problem` `unmapped` when it sells none, "
"`retired` when the blank no longer sells it, `picked` when the store manager "
"picked it rather than it being matched on the variation's attributes; null "
"when it is not personalised on a blank."
msgstr ""
"Varje variant anger också `pixonaut_variant`, grundproduktvarianten som den "
"trycks som: `ref` null och `problem` `unmapped` när den inte säljer någon, "
"`retired` när grundprodukten inte längre säljer den, `picked` när "
"butiksägaren har valt den i stället för att den matchats mot variantens "
"attribut; null när den inte är personaliserad på en grundprodukt."

#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:290
msgid ""
"And `pixonaut_setup`: `own_setup` true when the variation has a Pixonaut "
"setup of its own, false when it follows its product; `blank_id` and `sides` "
"(`template_id`, `template_pinned`, `placement_id`, `label`, `mode`) are "
"those it is sold under, its product's when it follows it. Change it with "
"`set-product-setup`."
msgstr ""
"Och `pixonaut_setup`: `own_setup` true när varianten har egna Pixonaut-"
"inställningar, false när den följer sin produkt; `blank_id` och `sides` "
"(`template_id`, `template_pinned`, `placement_id`, `label`, `mode`) är de "
"som den säljs med, produktens när den följer den. Ändra dem med `set-product-"
"setup`."

#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:308
msgid "The route's query parameters, e.g. search, page and per_page."
msgstr "Routens frågeparametrar, t.ex. search, page och per_page."

#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:317
msgid "The whole new list."
msgstr "Hela den nya listan."

#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:329
msgid "The fields as the route takes them."
msgstr "Fälten i den form routen tar emot dem."

#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:330
msgid "Only the fields to change, as the route takes them."
msgstr "Bara de fält som ska ändras, i den form routen tar emot dem."

#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:338
msgid "Delete it for good rather than move it to the trash."
msgstr "Radera permanent i stället för att flytta till papperskorgen."

#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:359
msgid "Dates and times are RFC 3339, with their offset."
msgstr "Datum och tider anges enligt RFC 3339, med sin tidsförskjutning."

#. translators: 1: a REST API route; 2: a sentence on how dates are written.
#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:364
#, php-format
msgid "What the REST route %1$s answers, without its links. %2$s"
msgstr "Vad REST-routen %1$s svarar, utan dess länkar. %2$s"

#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:441
msgid ""
"Each also gives `pixonaut_validity`: `valid` false when its Pixonaut setup "
"has a problem and it cannot be bought until it is fixed, with the `reason` "
"as a code and the `message` the product screen shows for it, both null when "
"valid."
msgstr ""
"Var och en anger också `pixonaut_validity`: `valid` false när dess Pixonaut-"
"inställningar har ett problem och den inte går att köpa förrän det är "
"åtgärdat, med orsaken som kod i `reason` och texten som produktens "
"redigeringssida visar för den i `message`, båda null när den är giltig."

#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:475
msgid "The store refused it."
msgstr "Butiken avvisade det."

#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:491
msgid "Give the file's public URL as fields.source_url."
msgstr "Ange filens offentliga URL som fields.source_url."

#. translators: %s: the largest file the store takes, e.g. "64 MB".
#: src/Abilities/Store/ResourceAbility.php:502
#: src/Catalogue/SplitCardImageCopies.php:271
#, php-format
