msgstr "Ingen mall är vald. Välj en %s."

#. translators: %s: where the settings are, e.g. "the product's Pixonaut tab".
#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:286
#, php-format
msgid ""
"No print position is chosen for where on the blank the design is printed. "
"Choose one in %s."
msgstr ""
"Ingen tryckposition är vald för var på grundprodukten designen ska tryckas. "
"Välj en %s."

#. translators: %s: where the settings are, e.g. "the product's Pixonaut tab".
#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:292
#, php-format
msgid "The blank no longer exists in Pixonaut. Choose another blank in %s."
msgstr ""
"Grundprodukten finns inte längre i Pixonaut. Välj en annan grundprodukt %s."

#. translators: %s: where the settings are, e.g. "the product's Pixonaut tab".
#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:298
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The blank is deleted in Pixonaut. Restore it in the Pixonaut studio, or "
"choose another blank in %s."
msgstr ""
"Grundprodukten är raderad i Pixonaut. Återställ den i Pixonaut-studion, "
"eller välj en annan grundprodukt %s."

#. translators: %s: where the settings are, e.g. "the product's Pixonaut tab".
#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:304
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The blank no longer has this print position, or Pixonaut cannot size a print "
"for it. Choose another print position in %s."
msgstr ""
"Grundprodukten har inte längre den här tryckpositionen, eller så kan "
"Pixonaut inte anpassa ett tryck efter den. Välj en annan tryckposition %s."

#. translators: %s: where the settings are, e.g. "the product's Pixonaut tab".
#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:310
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The template is not published in Pixonaut, or no longer exists. Publish it "
"in the Pixonaut studio, or choose another template in %s."
msgstr ""
"Mallen är inte publicerad i Pixonaut eller finns inte längre. Publicera den "
"i Pixonaut-studion eller välj en annan mall %s."

#. translators: %s: where the settings are, e.g. "the product's Pixonaut tab".
#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:316
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The template is paused or deleted in Pixonaut. Make it live again in the "
"Pixonaut studio, or choose another template in %s."
msgstr ""
"Mallen är pausad eller raderad i Pixonaut. Aktivera den igen i Pixonaut-"
"studion, eller välj en annan mall %s."

#. translators: 1: most sides a product can have, 2: where the settings are, e.g. "the product's Pixonaut tab".
#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:322
#, php-format
msgid "A product has at most %1$d sides. Remove sides in %2$s."
msgstr "En produkt har högst %1$d sidor. Ta bort sidor %2$s."

#. translators: %s: where the settings are, e.g. "the product's Pixonaut tab".
#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:329
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Two sides use the same print position, and each print position can be one "
"side only. Choose another print position for one of them in %s."
msgstr ""
"Två sidor använder samma tryckposition, och varje tryckposition kan bara "
"vara en sida. Välj en annan tryckposition för en av dem %s."

#. translators: %s: where the settings are, e.g. "the product's Pixonaut tab".
#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:335
#, php-format
msgid "Two sides have the same key. Give each side its own in %s."
msgstr "Två sidor har samma nyckel. Ge varje sida en egen %s."

#. translators: %s: where the settings are, e.g. "the product's Pixonaut tab".
#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:341
#, php-format
msgid ""
"A custom print size has no width or height, or one that is not above zero. "
"Enter both in millimetres under the side’s print sizes in %s."
msgstr ""
"En anpassad tryckstorlek saknar bredd eller höjd, eller så är någon av dem "
"inte större än noll. Ange båda i millimeter under sidans tryckstorlekar %s."

#. translators: 1: most print sizes one side can offer, 2: where the settings are, e.g. "the product's Pixonaut tab".
#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:347
#, php-format
msgid ""
"A side offers at most %1$d print sizes. Remove sizes under the side’s print "
"sizes in %2$s."
msgstr ""
"En sida erbjuder högst %1$d tryckstorlekar. Ta bort storlekar under sidans "
"tryckstorlekar %2$s."

#. translators: %s: where the settings are, e.g. "the product's Pixonaut tab".
#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:354
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The side has no print size, and without a blank there is no print position "
"to take one from. Add a size in millimetres in %s, or choose a blank."
msgstr ""
"Sidan har ingen tryckstorlek, och utan grundprodukt finns det ingen "
"tryckposition att hämta en från. Lägg till en storlek i millimeter %s, eller "
"välj en grundprodukt."

#. translators: %s: where the product's settings are, e.g. "the product's Pixonaut tab".
#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:360
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Some variations have no print size. Add one in millimetres in %s, or one for "
"each value of an attribute there, or add one in each of those variations’ "
"Pixonaut fields."
msgstr ""
"Vissa varianter saknar tryckstorlek. Lägg till en i millimeter %s, eller en "
"för varje värde av ett attribut där, eller lägg till en i Pixonaut-fälten "
"för var och en av de varianterna."

#. translators: %s: where the settings are, e.g. "the product's Pixonaut tab".
#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:366
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The print size is larger than the print position can print. Enter a smaller "
"size, or choose the print position’s size, in %s."
msgstr ""
"Tryckstorleken är större än vad tryckpositionen kan trycka. Ange en mindre "
"storlek, eller välj tryckpositionens storlek, %s."

#. translators: %s: where the settings are, e.g. "the product's Pixonaut tab".
#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:372
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The print size does not match the template’s aspect ratio. Enter a size at "
"the template’s ratio, or choose the print position’s size, in %s."
msgstr ""
"Tryckstorleken stämmer inte med mallens bildförhållande. Ange en storlek i "
"mallens förhållande, eller välj tryckpositionens storlek, %s."

#. translators: %s: where the settings are, e.g. "the product's Pixonaut tab".
#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:378
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The print position is printed across its whole print area, so the print size "
"must be that area. Choose the print position’s size instead in %s."
msgstr ""
"Tryckpositionen trycks över hela sin tryckyta, så tryckstorleken måste vara "
"den ytan. Välj tryckpositionens storlek i stället %s."

#. translators: %s: where the settings are, e.g. "the product's Pixonaut tab".
#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:384
#, php-format
msgid ""
"An image in the template prints below its recommended resolution at this "
"size, and the Pixonaut workspace refuses such sizes. Upscale the image in "
"the Pixonaut studio, or choose a smaller print size in %s."
msgstr ""
"En bild i mallen trycks under sin rekommenderade upplösning i den här "
"storleken, och Pixonaut-arbetsytan tillåter inte sådana storlekar. Skala upp "
"bilden i Pixonaut-studion, eller välj en mindre tryckstorlek %s."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:388
msgid ""
"The template cannot be printed at the print area of this variation’s blank "
"variant. Choose a template that fits, or another variant, in the variation’s "
"Pixonaut fields, or stop selling the variation."
msgstr ""
"Mallen kan inte tryckas i tryckytan för den här variantens "
"grundproduktvariant. Välj en mall som passar, eller en annan "
"grundproduktvariant, i variantens Pixonaut-fält, eller sluta sälja varianten."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:390
msgid ""
"The variation’s own print size has not been checked since the product "
"changed. Update the product to check it again."
msgstr ""
"Variantens egen tryckstorlek har inte kontrollerats sedan produkten "
"ändrades. Uppdatera produkten för att kontrollera den igen."

#
#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:392
msgid ""
"Pixonaut could not check the configuration. It is checked again in a while; "
"if this stays, check the connection on the Pixonaut settings page, then "
"update the product."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut kunde inte kontrollera konfigurationen. Den kontrolleras igen om en "
"stund. Om det kvarstår, kontrollera anslutningen i Pixonaut-inställningarna "
"och uppdatera sedan produkten."

#. translators: %s: where the settings are, e.g. "the product's Pixonaut tab".
#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:396
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut refused the print size without saying why. Choose another print "
"size in %s, or update the product to ask again; if this stays, contact "
"Pixonaut."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut nekade tryckstorleken utan att säga varför. Välj en annan "
"tryckstorlek %s, eller uppdatera produkten för att fråga igen. Om det "
"kvarstår, kontakta Pixonaut."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:400
msgid ""
"The print size has not been checked with Pixonaut yet. It is checked in a "
"while, and this notice clears once it is."
msgstr ""
"Tryckstorleken har inte kontrollerats med Pixonaut än. Den kontrolleras om "
"en stund, och meddelandet försvinner när den är det."

#. translators: %s: where the settings are, e.g. "the product's Pixonaut tab".
#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:404
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut would not make the design of a fixed-design side. Check the side’s "
"template, print position and print size in %s, then update the product."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut ville inte skapa designen för en fast sida. Kontrollera sidans "
"mall, tryckposition och tryckstorlek %s och uppdatera sedan produkten."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:408
msgid ""
"Pixonaut would not make the design of a fixed-design side: the store may not "
"create and approve designs. Check the connection’s permissions in the "
"Pixonaut studio, then update the product."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut ville inte skapa designen för en fast sida: butiken får inte skapa "
"och godkänna designer. Kontrollera anslutningens behörigheter i Pixonaut-"
"studion och uppdatera sedan produkten."

#. translators: %s: where the settings are, e.g. "the product's Pixonaut tab".
#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:412
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The template of a fixed-design side does not fit the print position at any "
"of the blank’s sizes, so none of them can be printed. Choose a template that "
"fits in %s."
msgstr ""
"Mallen för en fast sida passar inte tryckpositionen i någon av "
"grundproduktens storlekar, så ingen av dem kan tryckas. Välj en mall som "
"passar %s."

#. translators: %s: where the settings are, e.g. "the product's Pixonaut tab".
#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:418
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The printshop prints only on a blank. Choose a blank, or a printshop that "
"prints without one, in %s."
msgstr ""
"Tryckeriet trycker bara på en grundprodukt. Välj en grundprodukt, eller ett "
"tryckeri som trycker utan grundprodukt, %s."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:422
msgid ""
"The configuration was saved by a newer version of Pixonaut for WooCommerce. "
"Update the plugin."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurationen sparades av en nyare version av Pixonaut for WooCommerce. "
"Uppdatera tillägget."

#. translators: %s: why, and what to do, e.g. "Pixonaut had a problem of its own. Update the product again in a while."
#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:440
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut would not make the design of a fixed-design side. %s"
msgstr "Pixonaut ville inte skapa designen för en fast sida. %s"

#. translators: %s: the code Pixonaut answered, e.g. "too_small", kept as it is.
#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:453
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut cannot print this configuration, and answered “%s”. Update Pixonaut "
"for WooCommerce, or contact Pixonaut with this code."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut kan inte trycka den här konfigurationen och svarade ”%s”. Uppdatera "
"Pixonaut for WooCommerce, eller kontakta Pixonaut och uppge den här koden."

#. translators: %l: the sizes, e.g. "XL and 3XL". Beside a template in the template search of the admin product page: the template cannot be printed at these sizes of the blank.
#: src/Catalogue/MisfitSizes.php:88
msgid "Cannot print at %l"
msgstr "Kan inte tryckas i %l"

#. translators: %l: the sizes, e.g. "XL and 3XL". Warning on a side of the admin product page.
#: src/Catalogue/MisfitSizes.php:104
msgid ""
"This template does not fit the placement at %l: it cannot be printed at "
"those sizes. Choose a template that fits every size, or stop selling those "
"sizes."
msgstr ""
"Den här mallen passar inte tryckpositionen i %l: den kan inte tryckas i de "
"storlekarna. Välj en mall som passar alla storlekar, eller sluta sälja de "
"storlekarna."

#: src/Catalogue/PixonautRefusal.php:107
msgid ""
"The store is not connected to Pixonaut. Connect it on the Pixonaut settings "
"page, then update the product."
msgstr ""
"Butiken är inte ansluten till Pixonaut. Anslut den i Pixonaut-"
"inställningarna och uppdatera sedan produkten."

#
#: src/Catalogue/PixonautRefusal.php:109
msgid ""
"Pixonaut could not be reached to check the configuration. It is checked "
"again in a while; if this stays, check the connection on the Pixonaut "
"settings page, then update the product."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut kunde inte nås för att kontrollera konfigurationen. Den "
"kontrolleras igen om en stund. Om det kvarstår, kontrollera anslutningen i "
"Pixonaut-inställningarna och uppdatera sedan produkten."

#: src/Catalogue/PixonautRefusal.php:111
msgid ""
"Pixonaut answered in a way this version of Pixonaut for WooCommerce does not "
"understand. Update the plugin, then update the product."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut svarade på ett sätt som den här versionen av Pixonaut for "
"WooCommerce inte förstår. Uppdatera tillägget och uppdatera sedan produkten."

#: src/Catalogue/PixonautRefusal.php:113
msgid ""
"Pixonaut no longer accepts the store’s connection. Connect the store again "
"on the Pixonaut settings page, then update the product."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut godtar inte längre butikens anslutning. Anslut butiken igen i "
"Pixonaut-inställningarna och uppdatera sedan produkten."

#: src/Catalogue/PixonautRefusal.php:115
msgid ""
"The store’s connection may not do this in Pixonaut. Check the connection’s "
"permissions in the Pixonaut studio, then update the product."
msgstr ""
"Butikens anslutning får inte göra det här i Pixonaut. Kontrollera "
"anslutningens behörigheter i Pixonaut-studion och uppdatera sedan produkten."

#: src/Catalogue/PixonautRefusal.php:117
msgid ""
"Pixonaut refused the store’s web address. If the store moved to another "
"address, connect it again on the Pixonaut settings page, then update the "
"product."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut nekade butikens webbadress. Om butiken har flyttat till en annan "
"adress, anslut den igen i Pixonaut-inställningarna och uppdatera sedan "
"produkten."

#: src/Catalogue/PixonautRefusal.php:119
msgid ""
"The Pixonaut workspace does not include the API. Check its plan in the "
"Pixonaut studio, then update the product."
msgstr ""
"API:t ingår inte i Pixonaut-arbetsytan. Kontrollera arbetsytans plan i "
"Pixonaut-studion och uppdatera sedan produkten."

#: src/Catalogue/PixonautRefusal.php:121
msgid ""
"The Pixonaut workspace is suspended. Contact Pixonaut to lift it, then "
"update the product."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut-arbetsytan är avstängd. Kontakta Pixonaut för att häva "
"avstängningen och uppdatera sedan produkten."

#: src/Catalogue/PixonautRefusal.php:125
msgid "Pixonaut had a problem of its own. Update the product again in a while."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut hade ett problem på sin sida. Uppdatera produkten igen om en stund."

#. translators: %s: where the settings are, e.g. "the product's Pixonaut tab".
#: src/Catalogue/PixonautRefusal.php:129
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The template, blank or print position no longer exists in Pixonaut. Choose "
"another in %s."
msgstr ""
"Mallen, grundprodukten eller tryckpositionen finns inte längre i Pixonaut. "
"Välj en annan %s."

#: src/Catalogue/PixonautRefusal.php:133
msgid ""
"Pixonaut could not read what the store sent. Update Pixonaut for "
"WooCommerce, then update the product."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut kunde inte läsa det som butiken skickade. Uppdatera Pixonaut for "
"WooCommerce och uppdatera sedan produkten."

#. translators: %s: where the settings are, e.g. "the product's Pixonaut tab".
#: src/Catalogue/PixonautRefusal.php:137
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The template’s own design breaks one of its rules at this print size. Fix "
"the template in the Pixonaut studio, or choose another size or template in "
"%s."
msgstr ""
"Mallens egen design bryter mot en av mallens regler i den här "
"tryckstorleken. Rätta mallen i Pixonaut-studion, eller välj en annan storlek "
"eller mall %s."

#. translators: %s: where the settings are, e.g. "the product's Pixonaut tab".
#: src/Catalogue/PixonautRefusal.php:143
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The template cannot be made with the blank’s print technique, such as "
"embroidery or spot colours. Choose a template made for it in %s."
msgstr ""
"Mallen kan inte framställas med grundproduktens tryckteknik, till exempel "
"brodyr eller dekorfärger. Välj en mall som är gjord för den %s."

#: src/Catalogue/PixonautRefusal.php:147
msgid ""
"Pixonaut could not read the template’s design. Publish the template again in "
"the Pixonaut studio, then update the product."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut kunde inte läsa mallens design. Publicera mallen igen i Pixonaut-"
"studion och uppdatera sedan produkten."

#: src/Catalogue/PixonautRefusal.php:149
msgid ""
"Pixonaut could not use an earlier proof of the design. Update the product "
"again."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut kunde inte använda en tidigare korrektur av designen. Uppdatera "
"produkten igen."

#: src/Catalogue/PixonautRefusal.php:153
msgid ""
"The blank needs a variant for this print position, or the variant chosen is "
"not one of the blank’s. Pick the variant in the variation’s Pixonaut fields."
msgstr ""
"Grundprodukten behöver en grundproduktvariant för den här tryckpositionen, "
"eller så hör den valda grundproduktvarianten inte till grundprodukten. Välj "
"grundproduktvarianten i variantens Pixonaut-fält."

#. translators: %s: where the settings are, e.g. "the product's Pixonaut tab".
#: src/Catalogue/PixonautRefusal.php:157
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The printshop is unknown, disconnected, unavailable, or not the one the "
"blank is printed at. Choose another printshop in %s, or connect it again in "
"the Pixonaut studio."
msgstr ""
"Tryckeriet är okänt, frånkopplat, otillgängligt eller inte det tryckeri som "
"grundprodukten trycks hos. Välj ett annat tryckeri %s, eller anslut det igen "
"i Pixonaut-studion."

#: src/Catalogue/PixonautRefusal.php:174
msgid ""
"Pixonaut got more requests from the store than it takes at once. The "
"configuration is checked again by itself in a moment; there is nothing to do."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut har fått fler förfrågningar från butiken än den tar emot på en "
"gång. Konfigurationen kontrolleras igen automatiskt om en liten stund; du "
"behöver inte göra något."

#. translators: %s: a time of day in the site's time format, e.g. "14:05".
#: src/Catalogue/PixonautRefusal.php:178
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut got more requests from the store than it takes at once. The "
"configuration is checked again by itself at %s; there is nothing to do."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut har fått fler förfrågningar från butiken än den tar emot på en "
"gång. Konfigurationen kontrolleras igen automatiskt kl. %s; du behöver inte "
"göra något."

#: src/Catalogue/SplitCardImageCopies.php:302
msgid "The card's image could not be copied from its URL."
msgstr "Det gick inte att kopiera kortets bild från dess URL."

#: src/Catalogue/VariationCombinations.php:84
msgid ""
"The product has no attribute used for variations: add the attributes and "
"values it offers first."
msgstr ""
"Produkten har inget attribut som används för varianter: lägg först till de "
"attribut och värden den erbjuder."

#: src/Catalogue/VariationCombinations.php:87
msgid "The plan names no blank."
msgstr "Planen anger ingen grundprodukt."

#. translators: 1: a variation's values, e.g. "Size: M, Frame: Black". 2 and 3: two blanks' ids.
#: src/Catalogue/VariationCombinations.php:105
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Both %2$s and %3$s would sell %1$s: give each blank values of its own to "
"pick it by."
msgstr ""
"Både %2$s och %3$s skulle sälja %1$s: ge varje grundprodukt egna värden att "
"väljas efter."

#. translators: 1 and 2: two blanks' ids.
#: src/Catalogue/VariationCombinations.php:135
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Both %1$s and %2$s would sell the same values: give each blank a value of "
"its own, of an attribute both name, to pick it by."
msgstr ""
"Både %1$s och %2$s skulle sälja samma värden: ge varje grundprodukt ett eget "
"värde att väljas efter, i ett attribut som båda anger."

#: src/Catalogue/VariationCombinations.php:214
msgid "Any"
msgstr "Valfri"

#. translators: 1: an attribute's name, e.g. pa_frame. 2: a blank's id.
#: src/Catalogue/VariationCombinations.php:240
#, php-format
msgid "The product has no attribute %1$s used for variations to pick %2$s by."
msgstr ""
"Produkten har inget attribut %1$s som används för varianter att välja %2$s "
"efter."

#. translators: 1: a value. 2: an attribute's name.
#: src/Catalogue/VariationCombinations.php:247
#, php-format
msgid "The product does not offer %1$s for %2$s."
msgstr "Produkten erbjuder inte %1$s för %2$s."

#. translators: 1: a variation's id. 2: its values, e.g. "Size: Any, Frame: Black". 3: values the plan offers, e.g. "Size: M, Frame: Black".
#: src/Catalogue/VariationCombinations.php:349
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Variation #%1$d (%2$s) is sold for \"Any\" value, and so for %3$s, which the "
"plan offers as a variation of its own. Give the variation its values, or "
"disable it, first."
msgstr ""
"Variant #%1$d (%2$s) säljs med \"Valfri\" som värde och därmed även som "
"%3$s, som planen erbjuder som en egen variant. Ge först varianten dess egna "
"värden, eller inaktivera den."

#. translators: 1: an option's name. 2: a blank's id.
#: src/Catalogue/VariationCombinations.php:475
#, php-format
msgid "The blank %2$s has no option %1$s."
msgstr "Grundprodukten %2$s har inget alternativ %1$s."

#. translators: 1: an option's name. 2: a blank's id. 3: its values, comma-separated.
#: src/Catalogue/VariationCombinations.php:491
#, php-format
msgid ""
"No attribute offers the option %1$s of %2$s, which has several values "
"(%3$s): name the one to sell in the entry's fixed options, or link an "
"attribute to it."
msgstr ""
"Inget attribut erbjuder alternativet %1$s i %2$s, som har flera värden "
"(%3$s): ange vilket som ska säljas i postens fasta alternativ, eller koppla "
"ett attribut till det."

#. translators: %d: the most variations a plan may make.
#: src/Catalogue/VariationCombinations.php:553
#, php-format
msgid "The plan offers more than %d variations."
msgstr "Planen erbjuder fler än %d varianter."

#: src/Catalogue/VariationPictureCost.php:216
msgid "No variation pictures are deleted: no variation has one only it shows."
msgstr ""
"Inga variantbilder tas bort: ingen variant har en bild som bara den visar."

#. translators: 1: a number of pictures, 2: an amount of disk space, e.g. 310 MB.
#: src/Catalogue/VariationPictureCost.php:220
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Deletes about %1$s variation picture nothing else uses, freeing about %2$s "
"of your shop's storage."
msgid_plural ""
"Deletes about %1$s variation pictures nothing else uses, freeing about %2$s "
"of your shop's storage."
msgstr[0] ""
