msgstr "Automatiskt: så mycket som kundens enhet och anslutning tillåter"

#. translators: Option in the settings for preloading product sides in the designer. The merchant reads it.
#: src/Storefront/Preload.php:50
msgid "In the background, one at a time"
msgstr "I bakgrunden, en i taget"

#. translators: Option in the settings for preloading product sides in the designer. The merchant reads it.
#: src/Storefront/Preload.php:52
msgid "Off: load each one when it is shown"
msgstr "Av: ladda var och en när den visas"

#. translators: %s: a price, such as "180 kr". Beside an option of a product, such as a frame, on its page: what choosing it adds to the product's price. The customer reads it.
#: src/Storefront/ProductChoicePrices.php:164
#, php-format
msgid "+%s"
msgstr "+%s"

#. translators: %s: a price, such as "469 kr". Beside an option of a product, such as a size, on its page: the lowest price the product has with it. The customer reads it.
#: src/Storefront/ProductChoicePrices.php:166
#, php-format
msgid "from %s"
msgstr "från %s"

#. translators: 1: an option of a product, such as "50×70"; 2: what it shows as its price, such as "599 kr", "+180 kr" or "from 469 kr". An option in a product page's dropdown. The customer reads it.
#: src/Storefront/ProductChoicePrices.php:171
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s · %2$s"
msgstr "%1$s · %2$s"

#. translators: %d: The longest name, in characters. Refusal of the name an attribute goes by in the shop's addresses.
#: src/Storefront/QueryNames.php:220
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Use lowercase letters, digits, and hyphens or underscores between them, at "
"most %d characters."
msgstr ""
"Använd små bokstäver och siffror, med bindestreck eller understreck mellan "
"dem, högst %d tecken."

#. translators: %s: The refused name. Refusal of the name an attribute goes by in the shop's addresses.
#: src/Storefront/QueryNames.php:224
#, php-format
msgid ""
"WordPress or WooCommerce already reads “%s” in the shop's addresses. Choose "
"another name."
msgstr ""
"WordPress eller WooCommerce läser redan ”%s” i butikens webbadresser. Välj "
"ett annat namn."

#. translators: 1: The refused name, 2: The attribute that has it. Refusal of the name an attribute goes by in the shop's addresses.
#: src/Storefront/QueryNames.php:230
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The attribute %2$s already goes by “%1$s” in the shop's addresses. Choose "
"another name."
msgstr ""
"Attributet %2$s heter redan ”%1$s” i butikens webbadresser. Välj ett annat "
"namn."

#: src/Storefront/UnavailableProduct.php:101
msgid ""
"Shoppers do not see this product in the shop, search or related products, "
"and cannot buy it: its template is paused or not published in Pixonaut. Make "
"the template live in the Pixonaut studio to sell it again."
msgstr ""
"Kunderna ser inte den här produkten i butiken, sökningen eller bland "
"relaterade produkter och kan inte köpa den: dess mall är pausad eller inte "
"publicerad i Pixonaut. Aktivera mallen i Pixonaut-studion för att sälja "
"produkten igen."

#. translators: %s: the product's name.
#: src/Storefront/UnavailableReports.php:191
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Customers cannot personalise “%s”: this version of Pixonaut for WooCommerce "
"is older than the product’s template. Update the Pixonaut for WooCommerce "
"plugin to fix this."
msgstr ""
"Kunder kan inte personalisera ”%s”: den här versionen av Pixonaut for "
"WooCommerce är äldre än produktens mall. Uppdatera tillägget Pixonaut for "
"WooCommerce för att åtgärda det."

#. translators: 1: the product's name, 2: the host the SDK loads from, e.g. cdn.pixonaut.app.
#: src/Storefront/UnavailableReports.php:201
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The Pixonaut designer could not start for a customer on “%1$s”, so they "
"could not personalise it. Check that the site lets the browser load and run "
"the Pixonaut SDK from %2$s (see Content Security Policy in the Pixonaut for "
"WooCommerce developer docs)."
msgstr ""
"Pixonauts designverktyg kunde inte starta för en kund på ”%1$s”, så kunden "
"kunde inte personalisera produkten. Kontrollera att webbplatsen låter "
"webbläsaren ladda och köra Pixonauts SDK från %2$s (se Content Security "
"Policy i utvecklardokumentationen för Pixonaut for WooCommerce)."

#. translators: 1: the product's name, 2: the side's name, e.g. Front.
#: src/Storefront/UnavailableReports.php:239
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut no longer has the placement that the %2$s side of “%1$s” prints on, "
"so customers cannot personalise it. Link the product to a placement again."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut har inte längre placeringen som sidan %2$s av ”%1$s” trycks på, så "
"kunder kan inte personalisera den. Koppla produkten till en placering igen."

#. translators: Title of the update channel setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant.
#: src/Updates/UpdateChannel.php:77
msgid "Updates"
msgstr "Uppdateringar"

#: src/Updates/UpdateChannel.php:78
msgid ""
"Beta releases bring new features before they are stable. Use them on a "
"staging site first."
msgstr ""
"Betaversioner ger nya funktioner innan de är stabila. Använd dem på en "
"staging-webbplats först."

#. translators: Option in the update channel setting, shown to the merchant: only stable plugin releases.
#: src/Updates/UpdateChannel.php:82
msgid "Stable releases"
msgstr "Stabila versioner"

#. translators: Option in the update channel setting, shown to the merchant: also pre-release versions of the plugin.
#: src/Updates/UpdateChannel.php:84
msgid "Beta releases"
msgstr "Betaversioner"

#. translators: %s: the new version, e.g. 2.0.0.
#: src/Updates/UpgradeNotice.php:49
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Version %s is a major update and may hold breaking changes. Read its "
"changelog and back up your site before you update."
msgstr ""
"Version %s är en större uppdatering och kan innehålla ändringar som inte är "
"bakåtkompatibla. Läs dess ändringslogg och säkerhetskopiera webbplatsen "
"innan du uppdaterar."

#. translators: %s: why Pixonaut did not answer, e.g. rate_limited.
#: src/Webhooks/Endpoint.php:199
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut did not send the test request (%s)."
msgstr "Pixonaut skickade inte testförfrågan (%s)."

#. translators: Label of a text field on the screen that adds or edits a product attribute: the short name the attribute goes by in the shop's web addresses.
#: templates/admin/attribute-query-name-field.php:23
msgid "Name in addresses"
msgstr "Namn i webbadresser"

#. translators: Help under the "Name in addresses" field on the screen that adds or edits a product attribute. "?size=50x70-cm" is an example of a web address's query; keep it as it is.
#: templates/admin/attribute-query-name-field.php:25
msgid ""
"The name a product page's address and the shop's filters give this "
"attribute, as in ?size=50x70-cm: lowercase letters, digits, and hyphens or "
"underscores. Left empty, it goes by its slug."
msgstr ""
"Namnet som en produktsidas webbadress och butikens filter ger det här "
"attributet, som i ?size=50x70-cm: små bokstäver, siffror och bindestreck "
"eller understreck. Lämnas det tomt används attributets slug."

#. translators: %s: Why the name was refused. Shown under the "Name in addresses" field on the screen that adds or edits a product attribute, after the attribute was saved.
#: templates/admin/attribute-query-name-field.php:27
#, php-format
msgid "The attribute was saved without this name in addresses: %s"
msgstr "Attributet sparades utan det här namnet i webbadresser: %s"

#. translators: Label of a select on the screen that edits a product attribute: the option of the Pixonaut blank (product base) the attribute stands for, such as a frame's Color.
#: templates/admin/blank-option-field.php:23
msgid "Blank option"
msgstr "Grundproduktens alternativ"

#. translators: Option of the "Blank option" select on the screen that edits a product attribute: the attribute stands for no option of the blank.
#: templates/admin/blank-option-field.php:25
msgctxt "blank option of an attribute"
msgid "Not linked"
msgstr "Inte kopplat"

#. translators: Help under the "Blank option" select on the screen that edits a product attribute.
#: templates/admin/blank-option-field.php:27
msgid ""
"The option of the Pixonaut blank this attribute stands for, such as a "
"frame's colour. Its values then pick the blank's variant and show in the "
"designer as the option's colour or picture swatches. The options listed are "
"those of the blanks the products with this attribute use."
msgstr ""
"Alternativet i Pixonaut-grundprodukten som detta attribut står för, till "
"exempel en rams färg. Dess värden väljer då grundproduktvariant och visas i "
"designverktyget som alternativets färg- eller bildknappar. Alternativen som "
"listas kommer från grundprodukterna som produkterna med detta attribut "
"använder."

#. translators: Column heading in the table of an attribute's values on the screen that edits a product attribute.
#: templates/admin/blank-option-field.php:29
msgctxt "attribute value"
msgid "Value"
msgstr "Värde"

#. translators: Column heading in the table of an attribute's values: the value of the blank's option each one stands for.
#: templates/admin/blank-option-field.php:31
msgid "Blank option value"
msgstr "Värde i grundproduktens alternativ"

#. translators: Option of a value's "Blank option value" select: the value stands for no value of the blank's option.
#: templates/admin/blank-option-field.php:33
msgctxt "blank option value of an attribute value"
msgid "Not linked"
msgstr "Inte kopplat"

#. translators: %s: the blank option's value of the same name as the attribute value. Option of a value's "Blank option value" select: the value stands for the option value of its name.
#: templates/admin/blank-option-field.php:35
#, php-format
msgid "Same name: %s"
msgstr "Samma namn: %s"

#. translators: Help under the table of an attribute's values on the screen that edits a product attribute.
#: templates/admin/blank-option-field.php:37
msgid ""
"A value that is not linked shows as text and picks no variant by this "
"option. Save after choosing another option to list its values."
msgstr ""
"Ett värde som inte är kopplat visas som text och väljer ingen variant genom "
"detta alternativ. Spara efter att du valt ett annat alternativ för att lista "
"dess värden."

#. translators: Option of the "Blank option" select on the screen that edits a product attribute: the attribute's values are the page counts a book (a notebook, a photo book) is sold at.
#: templates/admin/blank-option-field.php:39
msgid "Page count (books)"
msgstr "Sidantal (böcker)"

#. translators: Column heading in the table of an attribute's values, when they are a book's page counts: the number of inner pages each one stands for.
#: templates/admin/blank-option-field.php:41
msgid "Inner pages"
msgstr "Sidor i inlagan"

#. translators: Help under the table of an attribute's values, when they are a book's page counts.
#: templates/admin/blank-option-field.php:43
msgid ""
"Each value sells the book at a count of inner pages (covers not counted), "
"priced by what the printshop charges at that count; a count it gives no "
"price for cannot be bought. A value left empty stands for the first number "
"in its name."
msgstr ""
"Varje värde säljer boken med ett visst antal sidor i inlagan (omslaget "
"räknas inte), till ett pris efter vad tryckeriet tar för det antalet; ett "
"antal som tryckeriet inte har något pris för går inte att köpa. Ett värde "
"som lämnas tomt står för det första talet i dess namn."

#. translators: Shown under the "Blank option" select on the screen that edits a product attribute, while the attribute stands for no option.
#: templates/admin/blank-option-field.php:47
msgid ""
"Not linked: its values show as text, and pick the blank's variant only where "
"they have the names of an option and its values."
msgstr ""
"Inte kopplat: värdena visas som text och väljer grundproduktvariant bara där "
"de har namnen på ett alternativ och dess värden."

#. translators: Label of a select on the screen that adds or edits a product attribute: which price its options show on a product page.
#: templates/admin/choice-price-field.php:21
msgid "Price beside each choice"
msgstr "Pris vid varje val"

#. translators: Help under the "Price beside each choice" select on the screen that adds or edits a product attribute.
#: templates/admin/choice-price-field.php:23
msgid ""
"For product options in the designer, as swatches or in the theme's own "
"field. An add-on, such as a hanger or a frame, shows what it adds to the "
"product without add-ons in the chosen size; the cheapest option shows "
"nothing. A base choice, such as a size, shows the lowest price the product "
"has with it, or its price with the customer's other choices, which follows "
"each choice they make. Prices come from the variations in stock, as the shop "
"shows them."
msgstr ""
"För produktalternativ i designverktyget, som knappar eller i temats eget "
"fält. Ett tillval, som en upphängning eller en ram, visar vad det lägger "
"till på produkten utan tillval i vald storlek; det billigaste alternativet "
"visar inget. Ett grundval, som en storlek, visar produktens lägsta pris med "
"det, eller dess pris med kundens övriga val, som följer varje val kunden "
"gör. Priserna kommer från varianterna i lager, som butiken visar dem."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:46
msgid "The store is connected to Pixonaut."
msgstr "Butiken är ansluten till Pixonaut."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:47
msgid "The store is disconnected from Pixonaut, and its keys are revoked."
msgstr "Butiken är frånkopplad från Pixonaut och dess nycklar är återkallade."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:48
msgid ""
"The store forgot its Pixonaut keys, but Pixonaut could not be reached to "
"revoke them. Disconnect the store on the API Keys page in the Pixonaut "
"studio too."
msgstr ""
"Butiken har glömt sina Pixonaut-nycklar, men Pixonaut kunde inte nås för att "
"återkalla dem. Koppla även från butiken på sidan API-nycklar i Pixonaut-"
"studion."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:49
msgid ""
"This site forgot the connection it was copied with. The site it was copied "
"from stays connected."
msgstr ""
"Den här webbplatsen har glömt anslutningen som den kopierades med. "
"Webbplatsen som den kopierades från förblir ansluten."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:50
msgid ""
"The store cannot connect while wp-admin is on another address than the site."
msgstr ""
"Butiken kan inte ansluta så länge wp-admin har en annan adress än "
"webbplatsen."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:51
msgid "Pixel can now make changes to your store."
msgstr "Pixel kan nu göra ändringar i din butik."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:52
msgid "Pixel can no longer make changes to your store."
msgstr "Pixel kan inte längre göra ändringar i din butik."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:53
msgid ""
"Pixel can no longer make changes to your store. Pixonaut could not be told, "
"so the studio may show the switch as on until it next tries."
msgstr ""
"Pixel kan inte längre göra ändringar i din butik. Pixonaut kunde inte "
"meddelas, så studion kan visa reglaget som på tills den försöker nästa gång."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:54
msgid ""
"Pixonaut could not be reached or did not accept the store's access, so the "
"switch stays off. Try again."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut gick inte att nå eller godtog inte butikens åtkomst, så reglaget "
"förblir av. Försök igen."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:55
msgid ""
"The store could not save the change, so Pixel may still be able to make "
"changes to your store. Check the database, then turn the switch off again."
msgstr ""
"Butiken kunde inte spara ändringen, så Pixel kanske fortfarande kan göra "
"ändringar i din butik. Kontrollera databasen och stäng sedan av reglaget "
"igen."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:56
msgid ""
"The store is connected to Pixonaut, but Pixonaut could not be reached or did "
"not accept the store's access, so Pixel cannot make changes to your store. "
"Turn the switch on below to try again."
msgstr ""
"Butiken är ansluten till Pixonaut, men Pixonaut gick inte att nå eller "
"godtog inte butikens åtkomst, så Pixel kan inte göra ändringar i din butik. "
"Slå på reglaget nedan för att försöka igen."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:57
msgid "Personalised products now also load on the www. address."
msgstr "Personaliserade produkter laddas nu även på www.-adressen."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:58
msgid "Personalised products load on the site's own address only."
msgstr "Personaliserade produkter laddas endast på webbplatsens egen adress."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:59
msgid ""
"Pixonaut did not change the addresses personalised products load on. Try "
"again."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut ändrade inte adresserna som personaliserade produkter laddas på. "
"Försök igen."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:60
msgid ""
"The store's brand is saved. Proofs, corrections and designer links made from "
"now on show it."
msgstr ""
"Butikens varumärke har sparats. Korrektur, rättelser och designlänkar som "
"skapas från och med nu visar det."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:61
msgid ""
"That brand is no longer in the Pixonaut workspace, so the store's brand did "
"not change. Choose another."
msgstr ""
"Varumärket finns inte längre i Pixonaut-arbetsytan, så butikens varumärke "
"ändrades inte. Välj ett annat."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:62
msgid ""
"Pixonaut did not confirm the change of the store's brand. Check the brand "
"shown below, and try again if it is not the one you chose."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut bekräftade inte ändringen av butikens varumärke. Kontrollera "
"varumärket som visas nedan och försök igen om det inte är det du valde."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:63
msgid ""
"The store's print file settings are saved. Print files made from now on "
"follow them, unless a template sets its own."
msgstr ""
"Butikens tryckfilsinställningar har sparats. Tryckfiler som skapas från och "
"med nu följer dem, om inte en mall har egna."

#. translators: %s: the limits of a live text tolerance, e.g. 1 to 100 px, or 0.01 to 5 mm.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:65
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The live text tolerance is %s, so the print file settings did not change. "
"Enter a tolerance in those limits, or leave it empty to follow the workspace."
msgstr ""
"Toleransen för redigerbar text ska vara %s, så tryckfilsinställningarna "
"ändrades inte. Ange en tolerans inom de gränserna, eller lämna fältet tomt "
"för att följa arbetsytan."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:66
msgid ""
"Pixonaut did not confirm the change of the store's print file settings. "
"Check the settings shown below, and try again if they are not the ones you "
"chose."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut bekräftade inte ändringen av butikens tryckfilsinställningar. "
"Kontrollera inställningarna som visas nedan och försök igen om de inte är de "
"du valde."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:67
msgid "That connect link expired or was already used. Connect again."
msgstr "Anslutningslänken har gått ut eller har redan använts. Anslut igen."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:68
msgid "The connect was cancelled in Pixonaut."
msgstr "Anslutningen avbröts i Pixonaut."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:69
msgid "Pixonaut did not approve the connect. Connect again."
msgstr "Pixonaut godkände inte anslutningen. Anslut igen."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:70
msgid ""
"Pixonaut did not hand over the store's keys: the approval expired or "
"Pixonaut could not be reached. Connect again."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut lämnade inte över butikens nycklar: godkännandet gick ut eller så "
"kunde Pixonaut inte nås. Anslut igen."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:71
msgid ""
"The Pixonaut workspace's plan connects no more stores. Upgrade the plan, or "
"disconnect another store on the API Keys page in the Pixonaut studio, then "
"connect again."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut-arbetsytans plan tillåter inte fler anslutna butiker. Uppgradera "
"planen, eller koppla från en annan butik på sidan API-nycklar i Pixonaut-"
"studion, och anslut sedan igen."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:72
msgid ""
"Pixonaut handed over the store's keys, but the store could not save them to "
"its database. Check the database, then connect again."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut lämnade över butikens nycklar, men butiken kunde inte spara dem i "
"sin databas. Kontrollera databasen och anslut sedan igen."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:73
msgid "Another connect or disconnect is in progress. Try again in a minute."
msgstr "En annan anslutning eller frånkoppling pågår. Försök igen om en minut."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:74
msgid ""
"The store could not remove its Pixonaut keys from its database. Check the "
"database, then disconnect again."
msgstr ""
"Butiken kunde inte ta bort sina Pixonaut-nycklar från databasen. Kontrollera "
"databasen och koppla sedan från igen."

#. translators: Name of the production Pixonaut workspace environment, where orders reach a printshop. Shown on the connection card.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:78
msgid "Live"
msgstr "Live"

#. translators: Name of the Pixonaut test environment, where orders never reach a printshop. Shown on the connection card, as a heading or button.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:80
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:100
msgid "Sandbox"
msgstr "Sandbox"

#. translators: The switch on the connection card that lets Pixel, Pixonaut's assistant, act on the store from the Pixonaut studio.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:82
msgid "Allow Pixel to make changes to your store"
msgstr "Låt Pixel göra ändringar i din butik"

#. translators: The switch on the connection card that lets Pixel, Pixonaut's assistant, act on the store from the Pixonaut studio.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:83
msgid ""
"Pixel in the Pixonaut studio can then read and change products, variations, "
"attributes, categories and tags, link templates to products, and read "
"orders. Nothing else in WordPress."
msgstr ""
"Pixel i Pixonaut-studion kan då läsa och ändra produkter, varianter, "
"attribut, kategorier och taggar, koppla mallar till produkter och läsa "
"beställningar. Inget annat i WordPress."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:92
msgid "You can turn this off at any time."
msgstr "Du kan stänga av det när som helst."

#. translators: Text before two buttons on the connection card, Live workspace and Sandbox, read: or connect only to the [Live workspace] [Sandbox].
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:98
msgid "or connect only to the"
msgstr "eller anslut bara till"

#. translators: Button on the connection card: connect only to the live Pixonaut workspace.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:99
msgid "Live workspace"
msgstr "Live-arbetsytan"

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:103
msgid ""
"Connect a staging or test site to the sandbox: its orders never reach a "
"printshop."
msgstr ""
"Anslut en staging- eller testwebbplats till sandboxen: dess beställningar "
"når aldrig ett tryckeri."

#. translators: %s: comma separated addresses the store sends requests to instead of Pixonaut's, e.g. http://localhost:8787. Shown to the merchant on the connection card.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:118
#, php-format
msgid "The store talks to %s instead of Pixonaut, and sends its key there."
msgstr ""
"Butiken kommunicerar med %s i stället för Pixonaut och skickar sin nyckel "
"dit."

#. translators: %s: an HTTP method and path of a Pixonaut API operation, e.g. GET /v1/connect. Shown to the merchant on the connection card.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:136
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut deprecated %s, which this plugin uses. Update Pixonaut for "
"WooCommerce."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut har fasat ut %s, som det här tillägget använder. Uppdatera Pixonaut "
"for WooCommerce."

#. translators: 1: an HTTP method and path of a Pixonaut API operation, e.g. GET /v1/connect, 2: the date it stops working. Shown to the merchant on the connection card.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:138
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut deprecated %1$s, which this plugin uses, and stops answering it on "
"%2$s. Update Pixonaut for WooCommerce before then."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut har fasat ut %1$s, som det här tillägget använder, och slutar svara "
"på det den %2$s. Uppdatera Pixonaut for WooCommerce innan dess."

#. translators: 1: wp-admin's origin, e.g. https://admin.example.com, 2: the site's origin, 3: HTML link to Settings > General. Shown to the merchant on the connection card.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:151
#, php-format
msgid ""
"wp-admin is at <code>%1$s</code> and the site at <code>%2$s</code>. Pixonaut "
"sends you back to wp-admin and delivers events to the REST API only on the "
"site's own address. Make the WordPress Address and the Site Address the same "
"under <a href=\"%3$s\">Settings &gt; General</a>, then connect."
msgstr ""
"wp-admin finns på <code>%1$s</code> och webbplatsen på <code>%2$s</code>. "
"Pixonaut skickar dig tillbaka till wp-admin och levererar händelser till "
"REST-API:t endast på webbplatsens egen adress. Gör WordPressadress och "
"Webbplatsadress likadana under <a href=\"%3$s\">Inställningar &gt; Allmänt</"
"a> och anslut sedan."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:163
msgid ""
"Connect the store to a Pixonaut workspace. You approve the connection in "
"Pixonaut and are sent back here."
msgstr ""
"Anslut butiken till en Pixonaut-arbetsyta. Du godkänner anslutningen i "
"Pixonaut och skickas sedan tillbaka hit."

#. translators: Button on the connection card that starts connecting the store; here Connect is a verb.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:164
msgid "Connect to Pixonaut"
msgstr "Anslut till Pixonaut"

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:169
msgid ""
"Site URL changed: this site is not the one that connected to Pixonaut, so "
"nothing is sent for the site it was copied from. Personalised products and "
"orders are paused until you connect this site. For a staging site, pick "
"Sandbox."
msgstr ""
"Webbplatsens URL har ändrats: den här webbplatsen är inte den som anslöt "
"till Pixonaut, så inget skickas för webbplatsen som den kopierades från. "
"Personaliserade produkter och beställningar är pausade tills du ansluter den "
"här webbplatsen. Välj Sandbox för en staging-webbplats."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:173
msgid ""
"Pixonaut no longer accepts this store's key: the store was disconnected in "
"Pixonaut, or its key was revoked. Personalised products and orders are "
"paused until you connect again."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut godtar inte längre den här butikens nyckel: butiken kopplades från "
"i Pixonaut, eller så återkallades dess nyckel. Personaliserade produkter och "
"beställningar är pausade tills du ansluter igen."

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:177
msgid ""
"Pixonaut could not be reached just now. This is the connection as it was "
"when the store connected."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut kunde inte nås just nu. Detta är anslutningen som den såg ut när "
"butiken anslöt."

#. translators: Row heading on the connection card: the name of the store's API key in Pixonaut.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:183
msgid "Key name"
msgstr "Nyckelnamn"

#. translators: Row heading on the connection card: the Pixonaut workspace the store is connected to.
#. translators: Row heading in developer tools: the Pixonaut workspace the store is connected to.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:187
#: templates/admin/developer-tools.php:194
msgid "Workspace"
msgstr "Arbetsyta"

#. translators: Row heading on the connection card: live or sandbox.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:191
msgid "Environment"
msgstr "Miljö"

#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:195
msgid "Orders placed in the sandbox never reach a printshop."
msgstr "Beställningar som läggs i sandboxen når aldrig ett tryckeri."

#. translators: Row heading on the connection card: the store's address.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:200
msgid "Site URL"
msgstr "Webbplatsens URL"

#. translators: Row heading on the connection card: the www. address of the site, which can be allowed in addition.
#: templates/admin/connection-card.php:205
msgid "Also allow"
msgstr "Tillåt även"

